(2527795, 349401, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice colours in the shingle beach. However the image just lacks any wow. Looking at the shadows it appears this was taken mid morning/afternoon when the sun was high. It may have been more atmospheric in the early dawn, which always gives an image something special.</td>', 'Nice colours in the shingle beach. However the image just lacks any wow. Looking at the shadows it appears this was taken mid morning/afternoon when the sun was high. It may have been more atmospheric in the early dawn, which always gives an image something special.', '2006-06-19 05:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2527797, 349168, 5354, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the perspective. The eye falls on the child and his cup, then escapes onward down the tunnel. If I had one slight critisism it would be that the tunnel exit might be slightly better just a little further right in the frame.</td>', 'Very nice use of the perspective. The eye falls on the child and his cup, then escapes onward down the tunnel. If I had one slight critisism it would be that the tunnel exit might be slightly better just a little further right in the frame.', '2006-06-19 05:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2527801, 349271, 5354, '<td valign="top">The green really snatches the eye away from the face, which from you title is what you wanted us to look at. Nice try, maybe tone down the green</td>', 'The green really snatches the eye away from the face, which from you title is what you wanted us to look at. Nice try, maybe tone down the green', '2006-06-19 05:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
