(2527840, 348847, 46314, '<td valign="top">The vast blackness definitely contributes to a sense of desolation, but I think that maybe the building tends to fall away too much into that darkness. Also the composition feels a bit unbalanced toward the right. Still, it fits the theme of the challenge well.</td>', 'The vast blackness definitely contributes to a sense of desolation, but I think that maybe the building tends to fall away too much into that darkness. Also the composition feels a bit unbalanced toward the right. Still, it fits the theme of the challenge well.', '2006-06-19 05:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
