(2527848, 348270, 46314, '<td valign="top">I like the way the diagonal lines of the horizon converge upon the model. But there''s something about the colours that bothers me a bit - the clouds seem so pink, yet that same pink cast isn''t on the model''s white top. They just don''t seem to blend well. Still, the composition makes it a good pic.</td>', 'I like the way the diagonal lines of the horizon converge upon the model. But there''s something about the colours that bothers me a bit - the clouds seem so pink, yet that same pink cast isn''t on the model''s white top. They just don''t seem to blend well. Still, the composition makes it a good pic.', '2006-06-19 06:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
