(2528003, 348854, 49326, '<td valign="top">I guess this picture will be on the last page. I don''t se the desolation, it''s too small, the composition isn''t very good, the subject is very uninteresting and the postprocessing isn''t any (I think). Good luck next time.</td>', 'I guess this picture will be on the last page. I don''t se the desolation, it''s too small, the composition isn''t very good, the subject is very uninteresting and the postprocessing isn''t any (I think). Good luck next time.', '2006-06-19 08:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
