(2528010, 348054, 49326, '<td valign="top">Very good colors. Infrared colors are always good. I think the subject could be a little near the camera. It''s a little hard to find it.</td>', 'Very good colors. Infrared colors are always good. I think the subject could be a little near the camera. It''s a little hard to find it.', '2006-06-19 08:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
