(2528098, 349239, 35804, '<td valign="top">Oh! Most excellent tonal and compositional work here...fantastic work.</td>', 'Oh! Most excellent tonal and compositional work here...fantastic work.', '2006-06-19 09:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528104, 349282, 35804, '<td valign="top">The expression on the dogs face could not be any better! Wonderful image.</td>', 'The expression on the dogs face could not be any better! Wonderful image.', '2006-06-19 09:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528108, 348996, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent.....</td>', 'Excellent.....', '2006-06-19 09:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528111, 349192, 35804, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus...and how strange it is to see a cat on a leash, it''s gaze seems to be begging for a bit of freedom...unusual indeed.</td>', 'Perfect focus...and how strange it is to see a cat on a leash, it''s gaze seems to be begging for a bit of freedom...unusual indeed.', '2006-06-19 09:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528125, 348991, 17377, '<td valign="top">Man this place looks familiar! The moon really ties the composition together.</td>', 'Man this place looks familiar! The moon really ties the composition together.', '2006-06-19 09:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528156, 349203, 47704, '<td valign="top">This would have been great but the frame in the middle just ruined a good pic.</td>', 'This would have been great but the frame in the middle just ruined a good pic.', '2006-06-19 09:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528177, 348839, 35804, '<td valign="top">Insanely strange...and that is exactly what makes this image great.</td>', 'Insanely strange...and that is exactly what makes this image great.', '2006-06-19 10:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528185, 349422, 35804, '<td valign="top">So harsh...so perfect...kudos on the killer comp within the square...excellent work.</td>', 'So harsh...so perfect...kudos on the killer comp within the square...excellent work.', '2006-06-19 10:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528203, 348991, 51538, '<td valign="top">Clean air, nice light, a hopeful moon, white snow, and good brown earth.  Let me see, my idea of desolation living in NYC is not this.  I expect everyone really has different ideas according to their locality.</td>', 'Clean air, nice light, a hopeful moon, white snow, and good brown earth.  Let me see, my idea of desolation living in NYC is not this.  I expect everyone really has different ideas according to their locality.', '2006-06-19 10:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528210, 349390, 51538, '<td valign="top">Yes, this does say desolate.  Nicely composed too.</td>', 'Yes, this does say desolate.  Nicely composed too.', '2006-06-19 10:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528215, 349146, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice tones.  The symbolism is not too bad either.</td>', 'Nice tones.  The symbolism is not too bad either.', '2006-06-19 10:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528218, 348761, 34192, '<td valign="top">I''ve glanced at all the thumb nails and this one jumps out at me.  Both a mental and a physical place.  Most people, coming up on this scene, would have walked right by searching for a ''lone tree'' or a person to put in the image.  This ''empty'' scene says so much more.  thank you. 10</td>', 'I''ve glanced at all the thumb nails and this one jumps out at me.  Both a mental and a physical place.  Most people, coming up on this scene, would have walked right by searching for a ''lone tree'' or a person to put in the image.  This ''empty'' scene says so much more.  thank you. 10', '2006-06-19 10:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528220, 349592, 51538, '<td valign="top">This does say desolation.  Good decision to enter this one.  I wonder if a little processing could have boosted it.</td>', 'This does say desolation.  Good decision to enter this one.  I wonder if a little processing could have boosted it.', '2006-06-19 10:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528224, 349422, 51538, '<td valign="top">Alone, solitary, thoughtful all come to mind.  Desolation is way down the list.</td>', 'Alone, solitary, thoughtful all come to mind.  Desolation is way down the list.', '2006-06-19 10:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528226, 349367, 51538, '<td valign="top">Watership Down a la Goat?  For the subject I think it does not quite make it.  If in an environment of slaughter, perhaps.</td>', 'Watership Down a la Goat?  For the subject I think it does not quite make it.  If in an environment of slaughter, perhaps.', '2006-06-19 10:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528227, 348096, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very Steinbeck.</td>', 'Very Steinbeck.', '2006-06-19 10:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528229, 347210, 51538, '<td valign="top">Too rich in colours to be desolate.</td>', 'Too rich in colours to be desolate.', '2006-06-19 10:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528231, 349611, 51538, '<td valign="top">Somewhat lacking in conrast and detail to be easy to see the symbolism.</td>', 'Somewhat lacking in conrast and detail to be easy to see the symbolism.', '2006-06-19 10:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528233, 349596, 51538, '<td valign="top">The greenery is a symbol of encraoching hope and life.  Remove that with some processing and then you have more complete desolation.</td>', 'The greenery is a symbol of encraoching hope and life.  Remove that with some processing and then you have more complete desolation.', '2006-06-19 10:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528235, 348106, 51538, '<td valign="top">Obsolete, left behind, alone all come to mind.  Desolation is a bit further down the list.</td>', 'Obsolete, left behind, alone all come to mind.  Desolation is a bit further down the list.', '2006-06-19 10:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528238, 348324, 51538, '<td valign="top">Thoughtful, reminiscing, blue all come to mind.  Desolation is further down the list.</td>', 'Thoughtful, reminiscing, blue all come to mind.  Desolation is further down the list.', '2006-06-19 10:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528246, 349599, 51538, '<td valign="top">Indeed, this has the potential to meet the challenge as implied with your title.  But, as it stands, it does not.  If only you had processed the image to remove some of the rich hues and textures.  Isolate some of the elements and create a city of desolate inhabitants (as NYC can be for some).</td>', 'Indeed, this has the potential to meet the challenge as implied with your title.  But, as it stands, it does not.  If only you had processed the image to remove some of the rich hues and textures.  Isolate some of the elements and create a city of desolate inhabitants (as NYC can be for some).', '2006-06-19 10:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528247, 349538, 51538, '<td valign="top">The symbolism is not quite accurate, IMO.  But it is a nice photo and great location.</td>', 'The symbolism is not quite accurate, IMO.  But it is a nice photo and great location.', '2006-06-19 10:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528248, 349246, 51538, '<td valign="top">Rich in contrast and colour.  Poor in desolation.</td>', 'Rich in contrast and colour.  Poor in desolation.', '2006-06-19 10:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528253, 347940, 51538, '<td valign="top">I think this does meet the concept.  Somehat hard to frame such a photo and give it impact.  But you did well using b/w.</td>', 'I think this does meet the concept.  Somehat hard to frame such a photo and give it impact.  But you did well using b/w.', '2006-06-19 10:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528255, 349436, 51538, '<td valign="top">Elegantly lonely, outlook, rich textures and muted colours.  But desolate?</td>', 'Elegantly lonely, outlook, rich textures and muted colours.  But desolate?', '2006-06-19 10:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528259, 349513, 51538, '<td valign="top">Good title and the image fits well.  Well composed and understated.  Nice work.</td>', 'Good title and the image fits well.  Well composed and understated.  Nice work.', '2006-06-19 10:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528263, 349218, 51538, '<td valign="top">A bit on the smooth side for my taste.</td>', 'A bit on the smooth side for my taste.', '2006-06-19 10:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528266, 349123, 51538, '<td valign="top">A bit on the colour-rich side to be totally desolate.  But otherwise it fits the bill.</td>', 'A bit on the colour-rich side to be totally desolate.  But otherwise it fits the bill.', '2006-06-19 10:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528267, 349274, 51538, '<td valign="top">In my mind, this is desolate.  Removed of interest, nature and wire.</td>', 'In my mind, this is desolate.  Removed of interest, nature and wire.', '2006-06-19 10:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528270, 348835, 51538, '<td valign="top">Too rich in colour to be desolate.  Come to Brooklyn and I will show you some canals which are so poluted they catch fire.  Maybe you will change your mind about the definition of desolation then?</td>', 'Too rich in colour to be desolate.  Come to Brooklyn and I will show you some canals which are so poluted they catch fire.  Maybe you will change your mind about the definition of desolation then?', '2006-06-19 10:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528272, 349500, 51538, '<td valign="top">Yes, a bit desolate indeed.  It does evoke that feeling and captures the literal meaning.  The colours do not work against the desolation as they do in many of the other images entered in this challenge.</td>', 'Yes, a bit desolate indeed.  It does evoke that feeling and captures the literal meaning.  The colours do not work against the desolation as they do in many of the other images entered in this challenge.', '2006-06-19 10:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528274, 347421, 51538, '<td valign="top">I know the scene.  I think you would have been better desaturating or blurring some of the sky, sign post area so as to get the viewer to focus on the siamese pipes and the cigarette mess.</td>', 'I know the scene.  I think you would have been better desaturating or blurring some of the sky, sign post area so as to get the viewer to focus on the siamese pipes and the cigarette mess.', '2006-06-19 10:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528277, 349051, 51538, '<td valign="top">This does say desolation quite well.  The tone used is effective.</td>', 'This does say desolation quite well.  The tone used is effective.', '2006-06-19 10:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528278, 348499, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of the best portraits in this challenge.  It does evoke the sense of desolation.</td>', 'One of the best portraits in this challenge.  It does evoke the sense of desolation.', '2006-06-19 10:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528279, 347943, 43410, '<td valign="top">here''s your winner right here. great job</td>', 'here''s your winner right here. great job', '2006-06-19 10:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528280, 349349, 51538, '<td valign="top">It is a great photo but what has it got to do with desolation?  Wonderful tones but to this viewer they do not evoke the feeling of desolation.  Lovely silhouette, but no symbolism related to desolation, IMO.</td>', 'It is a great photo but what has it got to do with desolation?  Wonderful tones but to this viewer they do not evoke the feeling of desolation.  Lovely silhouette, but no symbolism related to desolation, IMO.', '2006-06-19 10:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528281, 349433, 51538, '<td valign="top">This is very, very far from being desolate.  Come to Brooklyn and I will show you canals so polluted they catch on fire.</td>', 'This is very, very far from being desolate.  Come to Brooklyn and I will show you canals so polluted they catch on fire.', '2006-06-19 10:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528283, 348415, 51538, '<td valign="top">A fine animal, noble in its domain, caught, caged, and forgotten.  A sense of desolation is evoked.</td>', 'A fine animal, noble in its domain, caught, caged, and forgotten.  A sense of desolation is evoked.', '2006-06-19 10:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528286, 349075, 51538, '<td valign="top">Peaks (attaintment of goals), blue sky (clean air and freedom), lush forests (virgin lands).  Come to Brooklyn and I will show you canals that catch fire they are so polluted.  Let me take you by the hand and lead you through the streets of London Ill show you something to make you change your mind</td>', 'Peaks (attaintment of goals), blue sky (clean air and freedom), lush forests (virgin lands).  Come to Brooklyn and I will show you canals that catch fire they are so polluted.  Let me take you by the hand and lead you through the streets of London Ill show you something to make you change your mind', '2006-06-19 10:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528287, 348101, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of the very few landscapes in this challenge which does have a sense of desolation about it.</td>', 'One of the very few landscapes in this challenge which does have a sense of desolation about it.', '2006-06-19 11:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528290, 349481, 51538, '<td valign="top">Surreal, hypnotic, enlightened.  These things come to mind.  No sense of desolation is evoked or depicted.  But IMO it is a clever photo which has its uses.</td>', 'Surreal, hypnotic, enlightened.  These things come to mind.  No sense of desolation is evoked or depicted.  But IMO it is a clever photo which has its uses.', '2006-06-19 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528292, 348197, 51538, '<td valign="top">One person''s desolation is another person''s paradise.  Let me take you by the hand and lead you through the streets of London Ill show you something to make you change your mind or Brooklyn where canalas are so polluted they catch fire.</td>', 'One person''s desolation is another person''s paradise.  Let me take you by the hand and lead you through the streets of London Ill show you something to make you change your mind or Brooklyn where canalas are so polluted they catch fire.', '2006-06-19 11:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528295, 348054, 51538, '<td valign="top">Too rich in textures and colour to be anything like desolate.  Maybe a bit poisonous looking though.</td>', 'Too rich in textures and colour to be anything like desolate.  Maybe a bit poisonous looking though.', '2006-06-19 11:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528296, 349489, 51538, '<td valign="top">Alone indeed.  Grey in mood, if not blue.  Rich in texture and tone.  But not desolate.</td>', 'Alone indeed.  Grey in mood, if not blue.  Rich in texture and tone.  But not desolate.', '2006-06-19 11:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528326, 348850, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The hand is on the too pink and hydrated side to have died of thirst.  A little processing might have rectified that flaw.  But otherwise a good idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The hand is on the too pink and hydrated side to have died of thirst.  A little processing might have rectified that flaw.  But otherwise a good idea.', '2006-06-19 11:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528345, 348047, 51538, '<td valign="top">Desolate? but rich in colour, contrast and tone.  It defies the definition but is desolate.  Not the sort of desolate one gets in Brooklyn where canals are so polluted they catch on fire.  Brooklyn has both desolation of colour, of spirit, and even evokes that feeling.  However, I think the accuracy of the feeling your photo depicts is applicable.</td>', 'Desolate? but rich in colour, contrast and tone.  It defies the definition but is desolate.  Not the sort of desolate one gets in Brooklyn where canals are so polluted they catch on fire.  Brooklyn has both desolation of colour, of spirit, and even evokes that feeling.  However, I think the accuracy of the feeling your photo depicts is applicable.', '2006-06-19 11:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528348, 349055, 51538, '<td valign="top">Good processing IMO.  The depcition does evoke a feeling of desolation.</td>', 'Good processing IMO.  The depcition does evoke a feeling of desolation.', '2006-06-19 11:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528349, 348184, 36006, '<td valign="top">I am not convinced that he is living under a bridge.<br/> <br/>Nice comp, color nice, a bit soft on bottom close your iris more, light nice, great texture</td>', 'I am not convinced that he is living under a bridge. Nice comp, color nice, a bit soft on bottom close your iris more, light nice, great texture', '2006-06-19 11:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528352, 348508, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge.  The picture evokes the feeling of desolation.</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge.  The picture evokes the feeling of desolation.', '2006-06-19 11:20:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528353, 349024, 36006, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I am not convinced of Desolation.<br/> <br/>Definitions of desolation on the Web:<br/> <br/>*devastation: the state of being decayed or destroyed <br/>*bleakness: a bleak and desolate atmosphere; "the nakedness of the landscape" <br/>*forlornness: sadness resulting from being forsaken or abandoned <br/>*devastation: an event that results in total destruction <br/> <br/>nice comp, too soft around model, focal plane seems to be on the good eye, blacks are too deep, whites barely in, nice texture,bg distracting, light flat</td>', 'Sorry, but I am not convinced of Desolation. Definitions of desolation on the Web: *devastation: the state of being decayed or destroyed *bleakness: a bleak and desolate atmosphere; "the nakedness of the landscape" *forlornness: sadness resulting from being forsaken or abandoned *devastation: an event that results in total destruction  nice comp, too soft around model, focal plane seems to be on the good eye, blacks are too deep, whites barely in, nice texture,bg distracting, light flat', '2006-06-19 11:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528356, 349168, 51538, '<td valign="top">Is there a richness in desolation?  There must be because photographers often seek it out to depict.  In this image there is some sort of richness.  Desolation in my mind is not rich, it is poor and deprived in spirit (and in all the things such as colour, tone, texture etc which symbolize spirit).  It is, if you will, pseudo-photographer''s-desolation.  8 because we all live accoring to these weird rules ;-)</td>', 'Is there a richness in desolation?  There must be because photographers often seek it out to depict.  In this image there is some sort of richness.  Desolation in my mind is not rich, it is poor and deprived in spirit (and in all the things such as colour, tone, texture etc which symbolize spirit).  It is, if you will, pseudo-photographer''s-desolation.  8 because we all live accoring to these weird rules ;-)', '2006-06-19 11:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528359, 349023, 51538, '<td valign="top">That image is awful.  But that''s the requirement, right?  It evokes a terrible feeling.</td>', 'That image is awful.  But that''s the requirement, right?  It evokes a terrible feeling.', '2006-06-19 11:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528362, 349420, 51538, '<td valign="top">Very good interpretation.  One of the best inanimate - non-human content - photos of the challenge.</td>', 'Very good interpretation.  One of the best inanimate - non-human content - photos of the challenge.', '2006-06-19 11:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
