(2528367, 349021, 52336, '<td valign="top">I like it overall.  The b/w is great, the composition is good, but, and forgive me if untrue, it looks a tad posed in my opinion, which detracts for me.</td>', 'I like it overall.  The b/w is great, the composition is good, but, and forgive me if untrue, it looks a tad posed in my opinion, which detracts for me.', '2006-06-19 11:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
