(2528442, 349036, 46314, '<td valign="top">Interesting mix of elements in the photograph. I like the tone, contrast and the composition. The only thing that needs some improvement maybe is the perspective - lines seem to be falling over a bit.</td>', 'Interesting mix of elements in the photograph. I like the tone, contrast and the composition. The only thing that needs some improvement maybe is the perspective - lines seem to be falling over a bit.', '2006-06-19 11:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528449, 346768, 46314, '<td valign="top">The hand seems a bit distracting. Because of the way it is lit, it is difficult to perceive how the whole arm is posed - fingers seem to be floating in space. Otherwise, great idea for the them, and nice contrast.</td>', 'The hand seems a bit distracting. Because of the way it is lit, it is difficult to perceive how the whole arm is posed - fingers seem to be floating in space. Otherwise, great idea for the them, and nice contrast.', '2006-06-19 11:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528451, 349055, 46314, '<td valign="top">Really interesting effects, although somehow it just doesn''t have as much impact as it could have. I think maybe it''s the fogginess around his body. If that were all sharp, then I think the posterising effect would have been far more striking. Still, good photo for the theme.</td>', 'Really interesting effects, although somehow it just doesn''t have as much impact as it could have. I think maybe it''s the fogginess around his body. If that were all sharp, then I think the posterising effect would have been far more striking. Still, good photo for the theme.', '2006-06-19 11:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528454, 349481, 46314, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and well executed. I like the colour choice too.</td>', 'Great idea, and well executed. I like the colour choice too.', '2006-06-19 11:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
