(2528659, 349052, 59415, '<td valign="top">Only a few photos actually captured Desolation in my opinion and this is one of them.  I really get the feeling that you were trying to express in this image.  Out of all the hands to the face shots this one was actually believable.  Great Job, cool location.</td>', 'Only a few photos actually captured Desolation in my opinion and this is one of them.  I really get the feeling that you were trying to express in this image.  Out of all the hands to the face shots this one was actually believable.  Great Job, cool location.', '2006-06-19 13:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
