(2528669, 349367, 34659, '<td valign="top">That is one of the most frightening things I think I''ve ever seen...  HA  WOW...  I don''t know whether to laugh or cry.  I''m skeered!....  The editing is phenomenal.  Outstanding job.  WOW  The purple under the ears was pure genius...</td>', 'That is one of the most frightening things I think I''ve ever seen...  HA  WOW...  I don''t know whether to laugh or cry.  I''m skeered!....  The editing is phenomenal.  Outstanding job.  WOW  The purple under the ears was pure genius...', '2006-06-19 13:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528673, 348270, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like how this one is in color, and captures desolation.  I think the temptation would have been to go BW and the color adds so much to this shot.  It looks as if she is contemplating some sort of sad event in her life.  The model really sold this.</td>', 'I like how this one is in color, and captures desolation.  I think the temptation would have been to go BW and the color adds so much to this shot.  It looks as if she is contemplating some sort of sad event in her life.  The model really sold this.', '2006-06-19 13:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
