(2528678, 348596, 57886, '<td valign="top">Love it... I also like when I take pictures like that, lying on the ground taking the picture upwards :o)Then you see the sky more and things look, hm, just different :o) Just telling you.. Your picture is great..</td>', 'Love it... I also like when I take pictures like that, lying on the ground taking the picture upwards :o)Then you see the sky more and things look, hm, just different :o) Just telling you.. Your picture is great..', '2006-06-19 13:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528679, 349495, 59415, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, but find myself longing for more detail that I might have got if the shadows were not so dark.  Maybe a little less contrast?  At any rate great job.</td>', 'I really like this shot, but find myself longing for more detail that I might have got if the shadows were not so dark.  Maybe a little less contrast?  At any rate great job.', '2006-06-19 13:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528680, 349320, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think my only comment on this one is that it could have been a 10 in my book by having the subject straiter in frame.  That is just me though, and I think you did a great job capturing desolation.</td>', 'I think my only comment on this one is that it could have been a 10 in my book by having the subject straiter in frame.  That is just me though, and I think you did a great job capturing desolation.', '2006-06-19 13:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
