(2528821, 349486, 10848, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I like the detail in the center of the flower. However I know the effect you were looking for here with the withering, but I would like to have seen the petals more in focus since they show the most withering effect. Good overall image, I like the black and white makes it more emotional. 8</td>', 'Interesting shot. I like the detail in the center of the flower. However I know the effect you were looking for here with the withering, but I would like to have seen the petals more in focus since they show the most withering effect. Good overall image, I like the black and white makes it more emotional. 8', '2006-06-19 14:27:04.000000', NULL, 1);
