(2528895, 349461, 10848, '<td valign="top">Eeeek :) This is definitely desolate, and I might add a bit humerous. Good shot.</td>', 'Eeeek :) This is definitely desolate, and I might add a bit humerous. Good shot.', '2006-06-19 14:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528900, 349127, 52925, '<td valign="top">Lovely muted colors and very dramatic sky. However, you model looks more like she''s havig fun than your obvious intention.</td>', 'Lovely muted colors and very dramatic sky. However, you model looks more like she''s havig fun than your obvious intention.', '2006-06-19 14:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528902, 348342, 52925, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if this wouldn''t work better with some muted coloring.</td>', 'I''m wondering if this wouldn''t work better with some muted coloring.', '2006-06-19 14:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528906, 348347, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed image.  I wonder if it was rendered in b/w or duotone if that sense of left behind, dumped, desolation would be enhanced?</td>', 'Nicely composed image.  I wonder if it was rendered in b/w or duotone if that sense of left behind, dumped, desolation would be enhanced?', '2006-06-19 15:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528908, 348486, 51538, '<td valign="top">This is a very good interpretation of the idea of desolation.  The small picture bespeaks desolation in stronger visual words than do many of the large picture submissions.</td>', 'This is a very good interpretation of the idea of desolation.  The small picture bespeaks desolation in stronger visual words than do many of the large picture submissions.', '2006-06-19 15:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528911, 349499, 51538, '<td valign="top">The camoflaged dog amid an all-to-busy view of texture does have an overall depressing effect.  Desolation indeed.</td>', 'The camoflaged dog amid an all-to-busy view of texture does have an overall depressing effect.  Desolation indeed.', '2006-06-19 15:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528914, 349517, 51538, '<td valign="top">Romantic desolation.  The rust is lovely and the bleeding of that colour in hints onto the surrounding foliage is very effective.  Nice work.</td>', 'Romantic desolation.  The rust is lovely and the bleeding of that colour in hints onto the surrounding foliage is very effective.  Nice work.', '2006-06-19 15:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528915, 349515, 51538, '<td valign="top">Not the greatest photo - but certainly in my mind one of the more memorable views of something desolate.  A burned offering, like those spoken of in the bible.</td>', 'Not the greatest photo - but certainly in my mind one of the more memorable views of something desolate.  A burned offering, like those spoken of in the bible.', '2006-06-19 15:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528916, 348820, 51538, '<td valign="top">Cars, concrete, and roads are a sort of desolation in my opinion.  This deserted car park also works to evoke that feeling.</td>', 'Cars, concrete, and roads are a sort of desolation in my opinion.  This deserted car park also works to evoke that feeling.', '2006-06-19 15:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528917, 348549, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice title which implies a bigger story - as does the image.  It bespeaks the sense of desolation that many people think about when they hear the word.</td>', 'Nice title which implies a bigger story - as does the image.  It bespeaks the sense of desolation that many people think about when they hear the word.', '2006-06-19 15:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528919, 347943, 9690, '<td valign="top">How neat.  One of the best I have seen so far.  You may be cruisin'' for a ribbon!  10</td>', 'How neat.  One of the best I have seen so far.  You may be cruisin'' for a ribbon!  10', '2006-06-19 15:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528920, 349239, 51538, '<td valign="top">Arty desolation.  But bereft of all except the viewer and the hiker.  It fits.  Nice location.</td>', 'Arty desolation.  But bereft of all except the viewer and the hiker.  It fits.  Nice location.', '2006-06-19 15:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528923, 349481, 9690, '<td valign="top">How neat.  I love this!  The moon and street light give it a reference, but you are still drawn to the main subject.  Great job!  10</td>', 'How neat.  I love this!  The moon and street light give it a reference, but you are still drawn to the main subject.  Great job!  10', '2006-06-19 15:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528925, 349333, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice viewpoint in this photo.  You caught the minutaea and the story all in one frame.  I think it is really rather good actually.  I wonder how it could be made to pop against the others (very, very few) competent images in this challenge?</td>', 'Nice viewpoint in this photo.  You caught the minutaea and the story all in one frame.  I think it is really rather good actually.  I wonder how it could be made to pop against the others (very, very few) competent images in this challenge?', '2006-06-19 15:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528928, 349248, 51538, '<td valign="top">Nice interpretation.  The location and pose fit the billing.</td>', 'Nice interpretation.  The location and pose fit the billing.', '2006-06-19 15:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528931, 349226, 51538, '<td valign="top">INteresting without doubt.  But the position of the protagonist within the frame is a bit odd.  I expect you had very valid reasons for it being that way though - perhaps there was a Macdonalds restaurant just to the right ;-)</td>', 'INteresting without doubt.  But the position of the protagonist within the frame is a bit odd.  I expect you had very valid reasons for it being that way though - perhaps there was a Macdonalds restaurant just to the right ;-)', '2006-06-19 15:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528933, 348469, 51538, '<td valign="top">The steely, silver sky is very nice on my monitor.  The silver, bleached wood also stands out very well.  This bare-bones image makes a statement and does imply desolation.  Well done.</td>', 'The steely, silver sky is very nice on my monitor.  The silver, bleached wood also stands out very well.  This bare-bones image makes a statement and does imply desolation.  Well done.', '2006-06-19 15:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528937, 349299, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s quite a story going on there.</td>', 'That''s quite a story going on there.', '2006-06-19 15:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528941, 347943, 60503, '<td valign="top">Amazing! I am so in love with this picture! ^_^</td>', 'Amazing! I am so in love with this picture! ^_^', '2006-06-19 15:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528943, 349486, 51538, '<td valign="top">NIce interpretation and symbolism in your photo.  The tones used and the dead, dry texture imply desolation.  Understated but powerful.</td>', 'NIce interpretation and symbolism in your photo.  The tones used and the dead, dry texture imply desolation.  Understated but powerful.', '2006-06-19 15:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528950, 349312, 51538, '<td valign="top">This is an eye-catching image.  The rust red of the iron oxides on the dessicated lake? bed stand out.  The two twigs are rather an oddity.  If you had a couple of fish skeletons (not too white) or some such more subtle prop, the photo would have worked a little better to captivate the viewer''s attention.  An ant walking across this land of canyons would have done the job too.</td>', 'This is an eye-catching image.  The rust red of the iron oxides on the dessicated lake? bed stand out.  The two twigs are rather an oddity.  If you had a couple of fish skeletons (not too white) or some such more subtle prop, the photo would have worked a little better to captivate the viewer''s attention.  An ant walking across this land of canyons would have done the job too.', '2006-06-19 15:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528951, 349461, 40973, '<td valign="top">.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-17 11:09:43.</i></td>', '.', '2006-06-19 15:16:41.000000', '2006-08-17 12:09:43.000000', 1),
(2528954, 349495, 51538, '<td valign="top">Reminiscent also of prison camps the world over in various of the last century''s wars.  Creative license with the title might help.  I think it is nicely processed the the tones work well.</td>', 'Reminiscent also of prison camps the world over in various of the last century''s wars.  Creative license with the title might help.  I think it is nicely processed the the tones work well.', '2006-06-19 15:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528956, 349568, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is jolly nice.  i like the originally creative point of view, and the dark colours of the shed compared to the blown areas of sky, which unusually complements the feel of the image.  having the door open is a clever touch.  i like the state of the window; it conveys the impression of age nicely.  it''s good!  7.</td>', 'this is jolly nice.  i like the originally creative point of view, and the dark colours of the shed compared to the blown areas of sky, which unusually complements the feel of the image.  having the door open is a clever touch.  i like the state of the window; it conveys the impression of age nicely.  it''s good!  7.', '2006-06-19 15:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2528961, 349043, 51538, '<td valign="top">The colours and background make this image.  I like the fuzz effect.  Your title is really rather good as well.  Nice work, in total.  Good luck!</td>', 'The colours and background make this image.  I like the fuzz effect.  Your title is really rather good as well.  Nice work, in total.  Good luck!', '2006-06-19 15:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
