(2528965, 347939, 51538, '<td valign="top">Geology - ahh.  Plenty of desolation done by geologists worldwide - openstrip mines, tailings pits, mine run-off, red rivers here and there.  Rust, mud and blood.  I worked for several years in tin mines in the United Kingdom.</td>', 'Geology - ahh.  Plenty of desolation done by geologists worldwide - openstrip mines, tailings pits, mine run-off, red rivers here and there.  Rust, mud and blood.  I worked for several years in tin mines in the United Kingdom.', '2006-06-19 15:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
