(2529050, 349051, 34192, '<td valign="top">Okay, here goes.  I gave you a 7 (one of the few I did rate).  And I was going to comment but I had to eat.  I so love the surrealness of this image.  And I love that, while its in black and white, it doesn''t look like a black and white image.  I don''t know how to explain that but trust me.<br/> <br/>Why it isn''t scoring well?  You have to ask?  DPC craves the bright and shiny.  This is neither - lose 2 points for that.  DPC prefers simple - this isn''t that - lose another point.  DPC likes vibrant color - none here - there goes another point.  DPC wants a vision that requires no interpretation and if it does require one that it doesn''t detract from the feel good moment - minus one for missing that.  Where are we at?  5?  Add in the number of people that are scoring you down for does not meet challenge and your score should reside between 4.3 and 5.3.  Am I close?<br/> <br/>So, why did I give you a 7 and not anything higher?  My scoring allows 2 for meet challenge, 4 for technicals, 4 for emotion.  I gave you 4 for emotion, 1 for meeting challenge, 2 for technicals.  The contrast isn''t as high as I''d like it and the point of view and focus are slightly off and the cars look a little bit fake.  But its a really cool image. :)</td>', 'Okay, here goes.  I gave you a 7 (one of the few I did rate).  And I was going to comment but I had to eat.  I so love the surrealness of this image.  And I love that, while its in black and white, it doesn''t look like a black and white image.  I don''t know how to explain that but trust me. Why it isn''t scoring well?  You have to ask?  DPC craves the bright and shiny.  This is neither - lose 2 points for that.  DPC prefers simple - this isn''t that - lose another point.  DPC likes vibrant color - none here - there goes another point.  DPC wants a vision that requires no interpretation and if it does require one that it doesn''t detract from the feel good moment - minus one for missing that.  Where are we at?  5?  Add in the number of people that are scoring you down for does not meet challenge and your score should reside between 4.3 and 5.3.  Am I close? So, why did I give you a 7 and not anything higher?  My scoring allows 2 for meet challenge, 4 for technicals, 4 for emotion.  I gave you 4 for emotion, 1 for meeting challenge, 2 for technicals.  The contrast isn''t as high as I''d like it and the point of view and focus are slightly off and the cars look a little bit fake.  But its a really cool image. :)', '2006-06-19 15:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529060, 349351, 51538, '<td valign="top">I think the subject works well for the challenge.  The only thing which makes my eye dizzy is the blur going on - or is it my tired eyes?  The branches are like dried bones and enhance the sense of desolation.</td>', 'I think the subject works well for the challenge.  The only thing which makes my eye dizzy is the blur going on - or is it my tired eyes?  The branches are like dried bones and enhance the sense of desolation.', '2006-06-19 15:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529065, 349585, 35444, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I really like the feel of this photograph.  Great job.</td>', 'Wow.  I really like the feel of this photograph.  Great job.', '2006-06-19 15:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529069, 349248, 43774, '<td valign="top">One of the best photos I''ve seen in the challenge so far. Love the composition, his pose, the run-down building. I love that he fits right in the curve of the steps. Perfection!</td>', 'One of the best photos I''ve seen in the challenge so far. Love the composition, his pose, the run-down building. I love that he fits right in the curve of the steps. Perfection!', '2006-06-19 15:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529070, 348626, 51538, '<td valign="top">The pale sun balances the odd leaning pinacle.  The shadowy figure has just enough definition to be recognizable as a figure.  I like the grey tones.  It all works well.</td>', 'The pale sun balances the odd leaning pinacle.  The shadowy figure has just enough definition to be recognizable as a figure.  I like the grey tones.  It all works well.', '2006-06-19 15:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529071, 349420, 51875, '<td valign="top">Good idea and I like pretty much everything but the B/W treatment; I think the tones are a bit too washed out.</td>', 'Good idea and I like pretty much everything but the B/W treatment; I think the tones are a bit too washed out.', '2006-06-19 15:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529072, 349210, 35444, '<td valign="top">This is not only a beautiful picture but really looks desolate.</td>', 'This is not only a beautiful picture but really looks desolate.', '2006-06-19 15:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529073, 349239, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, very well done. Great that you included a person to give a sense of scale.</td>', 'Wow, very well done. Great that you included a person to give a sense of scale.', '2006-06-19 15:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529082, 348761, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines, leading into the fog, into nothing, into desolation....well done! That lone tree adds to the photo, too, gives us just a little bit more to look at.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines, leading into the fog, into nothing, into desolation....well done! That lone tree adds to the photo, too, gives us just a little bit more to look at.', '2006-06-19 15:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529083, 346905, 51538, '<td valign="top">Sitting on the floor is certainly a sign of adult desolation.  It''s a nicely composed image.  I would have preferred it to be a bit grittier and dirtier.  It is, IMO, a bit too clean, if you know what I mean.</td>', 'Sitting on the floor is certainly a sign of adult desolation.  It''s a nicely composed image.  I would have preferred it to be a bit grittier and dirtier.  It is, IMO, a bit too clean, if you know what I mean.', '2006-06-19 15:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529084, 348637, 43774, '<td valign="top">VERY well done!! Love the placement of the tree in the frame, excellent exposure/lighting. One of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'VERY well done!! Love the placement of the tree in the frame, excellent exposure/lighting. One of the best in the challenge.', '2006-06-19 15:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529088, 349595, 51538, '<td valign="top">They are sad and this looks like typical urban desolation.  Now we need to turn it into an eye-popping photo without taking away the sadness and ugliness.  How, is the question.  I''m not sure I have any suggestions.  Possibly it would have worked better if the photo had been taking on the skew.  I know, a head looking out of one window would have added the appeal needed.</td>', 'They are sad and this looks like typical urban desolation.  Now we need to turn it into an eye-popping photo without taking away the sadness and ugliness.  How, is the question.  I''m not sure I have any suggestions.  Possibly it would have worked better if the photo had been taking on the skew.  I know, a head looking out of one window would have added the appeal needed.', '2006-06-19 15:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529090, 349480, 51538, '<td valign="top">Rain is a good means of suggesting romance or sadness.  In this case, not bad.  A piece of wet paper lying on the ground, crumpled or partly folded would have added to the visual language you were using.</td>', 'Rain is a good means of suggesting romance or sadness.  In this case, not bad.  A piece of wet paper lying on the ground, crumpled or partly folded would have added to the visual language you were using.', '2006-06-19 15:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529101, 347277, 51538, '<td valign="top">Barbed wire is a nice visual word.  Dried dead plants also.  Sand is nice too.  I wonder if you might have been able to distill the sense of desolation down by removing some elements, reframing, or focusing down?  I am not sure.  I would just like to see some of the dilution taken out so the image was stronger.</td>', 'Barbed wire is a nice visual word.  Dried dead plants also.  Sand is nice too.  I wonder if you might have been able to distill the sense of desolation down by removing some elements, reframing, or focusing down?  I am not sure.  I would just like to see some of the dilution taken out so the image was stronger.', '2006-06-19 15:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529116, 349320, 51538, '<td valign="top">This is a great location for photos.  Barring savage guard dogs, I would have cut in for a closer series of photos from which to select on or more for processing.  The foregorund needs a bit of cutting here.</td>', 'This is a great location for photos.  Barring savage guard dogs, I would have cut in for a closer series of photos from which to select on or more for processing.  The foregorund needs a bit of cutting here.', '2006-06-19 15:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529117, 347874, 43774, '<td valign="top">Oh I really like this! Love the processing you did on it, love his pose and the reflection in the window. One of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Oh I really like this! Love the processing you did on it, love his pose and the reflection in the window. One of the best in the challenge.', '2006-06-19 15:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529119, 349210, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is nice. Good placement of the tree and good desaturation of the colours</td>', 'This is nice. Good placement of the tree and good desaturation of the colours', '2006-06-19 15:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529120, 349380, 51538, '<td valign="top">A great location.  Nice sky and reflections.  The b/w does imply more of a sorrowful feeling.  Might have been a bit better closer up.  Not sure without going there, of course.</td>', 'A great location.  Nice sky and reflections.  The b/w does imply more of a sorrowful feeling.  Might have been a bit better closer up.  Not sure without going there, of course.', '2006-06-19 15:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529124, 349461, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, very surreal and artsy! Love the colours and the placement and pose of the girl. Very creative!</td>', 'Wow, very surreal and artsy! Love the colours and the placement and pose of the girl. Very creative!', '2006-06-19 15:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529126, 348303, 43774, '<td valign="top">Well, this is one of the best yet. Love your attention to details (especially the watch the little boy is holding!). Great composition, very well done.</td>', 'Well, this is one of the best yet. Love your attention to details (especially the watch the little boy is holding!). Great composition, very well done.', '2006-06-19 15:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529130, 349376, 51538, '<td valign="top">Graffiti is a symbol of degeneration in our times.  It reflects paucity of spirit and education.  I think the location you chose well portrays desolation of the building - but also of the human spirit.  But we need to work on it a bit.  It needs a prop or something to bring it alive.  Some would use a cute punky girl, some a down-and-out looking young lad.  I might use something left behind as impications of past-gone humans - a broken broom... bottles...</td>', 'Graffiti is a symbol of degeneration in our times.  It reflects paucity of spirit and education.  I think the location you chose well portrays desolation of the building - but also of the human spirit.  But we need to work on it a bit.  It needs a prop or something to bring it alive.  Some would use a cute punky girl, some a down-and-out looking young lad.  I might use something left behind as impications of past-gone humans - a broken broom... bottles...', '2006-06-19 16:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529132, 348996, 51538, '<td valign="top">In Brooklyn''s filthy backstreets, where canals are so polluted they catch on fire, your vision of desolation looks like paradise.</td>', 'In Brooklyn''s filthy backstreets, where canals are so polluted they catch on fire, your vision of desolation looks like paradise.', '2006-06-19 16:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529134, 348262, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, interesting work of art! Great angle you chose, and a good sky to go along with it.</td>', 'Wow, interesting work of art! Great angle you chose, and a good sky to go along with it.', '2006-06-19 16:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529136, 349513, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is very well done. The rain and fog add to the feeling.</td>', 'This is very well done. The rain and fog add to the feeling.', '2006-06-19 16:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529141, 349052, 40667, '<td valign="top">Wow!! Really Love it! Amazing shot, and your model is amazing, she really makes the shot, along with her placing!!! The only thing i would have done is boost the contrast in the sky a little bit more, jsut a simple fix, but i''m sure you just overlooked it ;-) Love it!</td>', 'Wow!! Really Love it! Amazing shot, and your model is amazing, she really makes the shot, along with her placing!!! The only thing i would have done is boost the contrast in the sky a little bit more, jsut a simple fix, but i''m sure you just overlooked it ;-) Love it!', '2006-06-19 16:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529147, 349263, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very well done, I really like this. The burned tree is almost like a work of art with figures rising from the ashes.</td>', 'Very well done, I really like this. The burned tree is almost like a work of art with figures rising from the ashes.', '2006-06-19 16:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529149, 347943, 55221, '<td valign="top">Beautiful coloring and clarity... The contrast between the subject and the sun is very nice. Excellent work!</td>', 'Beautiful coloring and clarity... The contrast between the subject and the sun is very nice. Excellent work!', '2006-06-19 16:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
