(2529203, 349075, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wowweeee, what a shot!</td>', 'Wowweeee, what a shot!', '2006-06-19 16:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529211, 349590, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous shot. That barbed wire is a perfect frame for a desolate landscape. Can''t imagine why the boot is there, other than to add some interest (and it does add interest :-) I really love the b&amp;w conversion and treatment you''ve done.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous shot. That barbed wire is a perfect frame for a desolate landscape. Can''t imagine why the boot is there, other than to add some interest (and it does add interest :-) I really love the b&w conversion and treatment you''ve done.', '2006-06-19 16:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529220, 349239, 31133, '<td valign="top">This has to be a ribbon winner! What an amazing scene. I can''t wait to see where this is. Congratulations on a beautiful composition, too.</td>', 'This has to be a ribbon winner! What an amazing scene. I can''t wait to see where this is. Congratulations on a beautiful composition, too.', '2006-06-19 16:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529223, 349585, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the processing you did on this, good job. Nice use of angles, good placement of the sandals.</td>', 'I like the processing you did on this, good job. Nice use of angles, good placement of the sandals.', '2006-06-19 16:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529224, 346768, 43774, '<td valign="top">Good lighting in this, good expression on the person''s face, he (she?) looks forlorn and desolate.</td>', 'Good lighting in this, good expression on the person''s face, he (she?) looks forlorn and desolate.', '2006-06-19 16:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529226, 349422, 43774, '<td valign="top">A very artsy and surreal photo. I wish it were a tad bit brighter, it''s a little dark now.</td>', 'A very artsy and surreal photo. I wish it were a tad bit brighter, it''s a little dark now.', '2006-06-19 16:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529227, 349036, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very good. All elements work well together, from the old building covered with graffiti to the hearse and mourner in black. I have to wonder did you stumble upon this scene or set it up. Not many people have access to a hearse!</td>', 'Very good. All elements work well together, from the old building covered with graffiti to the hearse and mourner in black. I have to wonder did you stumble upon this scene or set it up. Not many people have access to a hearse!', '2006-06-19 16:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529228, 348797, 43774, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, the bird even seems to have a lonely look in his eye!</td>', 'A nice photo, the bird even seems to have a lonely look in his eye!', '2006-06-19 16:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529229, 348486, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is nice. Certainly has a feel of desolation and loneliness. The flower seems a bit over exposed though.</td>', 'This is nice. Certainly has a feel of desolation and loneliness. The flower seems a bit over exposed though.', '2006-06-19 16:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529230, 348850, 43774, '<td valign="top">What an interetsing angle you took this from. The hand looks huge, like 50 feet or more! I think I''d like to see more of the surrounding area. Good composition.</td>', 'What an interetsing angle you took this from. The hand looks huge, like 50 feet or more! I think I''d like to see more of the surrounding area. Good composition.', '2006-06-19 16:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529231, 348626, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like this. The fog adds to the feeling of desolation.</td>', 'I like this. The fog adds to the feeling of desolation.', '2006-06-19 16:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529232, 348383, 43774, '<td valign="top">Feels a little top heavy, but overall a good photo.</td>', 'Feels a little top heavy, but overall a good photo.', '2006-06-19 16:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529236, 347939, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this image, the DOF, the colours, the subject matter, well done.</td>', 'I like everything about this image, the DOF, the colours, the subject matter, well done.', '2006-06-19 16:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529245, 349596, 31133, '<td valign="top">I like the colors a lot, the loose floorboards, and the genrally abandoned feeling of the interior. The title works perfectly to describe why you chose to not crop out the sunshine and green leaves. It could use a slight counter-clockwise rotation though, ''cause it doesn''t look quite straight. Also, I like the angle, but would love to see it from a lower point of view to add some drama. Nice job, though - hope you don''t mind my comments.</td>', 'I like the colors a lot, the loose floorboards, and the genrally abandoned feeling of the interior. The title works perfectly to describe why you chose to not crop out the sunshine and green leaves. It could use a slight counter-clockwise rotation though, ''cause it doesn''t look quite straight. Also, I like the angle, but would love to see it from a lower point of view to add some drama. Nice job, though - hope you don''t mind my comments.', '2006-06-19 16:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529249, 349606, 59415, '<td valign="top">While the color of this image is not real flattering, it too seems desolate.  This picture really leaves it to your imagination as to what is going on.  I think you did a good job of relating what desolation is to you.</td>', 'While the color of this image is not real flattering, it too seems desolate.  This picture really leaves it to your imagination as to what is going on.  I think you did a good job of relating what desolation is to you.', '2006-06-19 16:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529251, 348996, 59415, '<td valign="top">The location of this is a bit strange to me, because it doesn''t feel desolate to me, however the barn definitly feels neglected and desolate.  The tone and color is amazing, I think you did a real nice job!</td>', 'The location of this is a bit strange to me, because it doesn''t feel desolate to me, however the barn definitly feels neglected and desolate.  The tone and color is amazing, I think you did a real nice job!', '2006-06-19 16:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529253, 349282, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is so sad I could cry. I hope he''s just posing for this shot. It''s a beautiful dog. The duotone works to bring out the depressing feeling of this image, but I''m not sure the blue tint works for me. Your angle, looking down on this poor dog, adds to the strong emotion I feel when looking at this (that is, it works).</td>', 'This is so sad I could cry. I hope he''s just posing for this shot. It''s a beautiful dog. The duotone works to bring out the depressing feeling of this image, but I''m not sure the blue tint works for me. Your angle, looking down on this poor dog, adds to the strong emotion I feel when looking at this (that is, it works).', '2006-06-19 17:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529256, 349481, 31133, '<td valign="top">Clever! I like the grouping of three lights, the face, the moon, and the streetlight. The glow on the model''s body is pretty cool.</td>', 'Clever! I like the grouping of three lights, the face, the moon, and the streetlight. The glow on the model''s body is pretty cool.', '2006-06-19 17:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529258, 349489, 59415, '<td valign="top">Nothing more desolate than to be alone.  That is a horrible feeling, and I think you captured it well.  I think I would have scored it even higher had the subject not been dead center escpecially with all the action going on with the waves to the right.  Just my opinion mind you.  Great Job! 9</td>', 'Nothing more desolate than to be alone.  That is a horrible feeling, and I think you captured it well.  I think I would have scored it even higher had the subject not been dead center escpecially with all the action going on with the waves to the right.  Just my opinion mind you.  Great Job! 9', '2006-06-19 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529263, 349344, 31133, '<td valign="top">I can''t decide if I like the grunge or not... but it''s certainly noticable, which is why I''m mentioning it :-) The black shadow is a little distracting for me, but I think it''s a great pose and camera angle. The bars might even give a feeling of imprisonment if the tops of the railing were not in the scene.</td>', 'I can''t decide if I like the grunge or not... but it''s certainly noticable, which is why I''m mentioning it :-) The black shadow is a little distracting for me, but I think it''s a great pose and camera angle. The bars might even give a feeling of imprisonment if the tops of the railing were not in the scene.', '2006-06-19 17:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529272, 349611, 36006, '<td valign="top">The first thing that strikes me about this image is that it is way too dark.<br/> <br/>comp ok, blacks too deep, whites just not there. In a b&amp;w pix, to be convincing, you need to have texture in your pure blacks and pure whites. Overall, it is hard for me to give a proper critique on the lighting, dof and texture due to the underexposed image.<br/> <br/>Always take the time to experiment with exposure even if it takes a couple of days to get it right. <br/> <br/>These challenges are not a race to see who can upload an image first, but to see who has a handle on their forethought, and settings of the machine.</td>', 'The first thing that strikes me about this image is that it is way too dark. comp ok, blacks too deep, whites just not there. In a b&w pix, to be convincing, you need to have texture in your pure blacks and pure whites. Overall, it is hard for me to give a proper critique on the lighting, dof and texture due to the underexposed image. Always take the time to experiment with exposure even if it takes a couple of days to get it right.  These challenges are not a race to see who can upload an image first, but to see who has a handle on their forethought, and settings of the machine.', '2006-06-19 17:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529276, 349359, 59415, '<td valign="top">The soft focus of this lends itself to moment.  The shadows to the left are a bit dark for me.  Great job, really looks desolate to me! 8</td>', 'The soft focus of this lends itself to moment.  The shadows to the left are a bit dark for me.  Great job, really looks desolate to me! 8', '2006-06-19 17:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529278, 349513, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like the water droplets coming off the bench. I wish they were a bit sharper though.  If there were just a touch more going on in the sky (like you can control that) I would have scored it 9-10.</td>', 'I like the water droplets coming off the bench. I wish they were a bit sharper though.  If there were just a touch more going on in the sky (like you can control that) I would have scored it 9-10.', '2006-06-19 17:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529279, 349410, 31133, '<td valign="top">This meets the challenge beautifully. I love the angle of the shipwreck bow (?) in the foreground and the fact that there''s just enough horizon and sky to add to the feeling of that beach going on forever and ever.</td>', 'This meets the challenge beautifully. I love the angle of the shipwreck bow (?) in the foreground and the fact that there''s just enough horizon and sky to add to the feeling of that beach going on forever and ever.', '2006-06-19 17:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529286, 349049, 36006, '<td valign="top">A bit humorous, but not very convincing as destitute.<br/> <br/>comp nice, good movement, color flat and over bright, blacks not bad, whites blown, ok texture, sharp enough, light flat,</td>', 'A bit humorous, but not very convincing as destitute. comp nice, good movement, color flat and over bright, blacks not bad, whites blown, ok texture, sharp enough, light flat,', '2006-06-19 17:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529290, 349592, 31133, '<td valign="top">Ah, what a very sad image. It''s impossible to imagine what it must feel like to lose a home this way. You''ve done a good job of portraying it in such a way that I can in any case come closer to imagining the horror and sadness of such a catastrophe. I''m so glad you didn''t clone out the telephone wires. The stairs, sitting there without a house could have a poem written about them.</td>', 'Ah, what a very sad image. It''s impossible to imagine what it must feel like to lose a home this way. You''ve done a good job of portraying it in such a way that I can in any case come closer to imagining the horror and sadness of such a catastrophe. I''m so glad you didn''t clone out the telephone wires. The stairs, sitting there without a house could have a poem written about them.', '2006-06-19 17:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529292, 349274, 36006, '<td valign="top">not convincing as destitute.<br/> <br/>comp needs work, nice lines, duotone interesting, power lines distracting, light poles distracting, blacks a bit too deep, whites not there, light could be better, dof ok but a bit blurred in bg.</td>', 'not convincing as destitute. comp needs work, nice lines, duotone interesting, power lines distracting, light poles distracting, blacks a bit too deep, whites not there, light could be better, dof ok but a bit blurred in bg.', '2006-06-19 17:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529324, 349598, 21915, '<td valign="top">good shot but needs work on the contrast</td>', 'good shot but needs work on the contrast', '2006-06-19 17:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529339, 348508, 45003, '<td valign="top">This must be one of Arsenal. Your stuff is great, your photos are often emotive and telling a story. I like that a lot. The green colors are great and I like the way the person ( is that you? ) is fading away. Gets a 10 from me and added to favorites.</td>', 'This must be one of Arsenal. Your stuff is great, your photos are often emotive and telling a story. I like that a lot. The green colors are great and I like the way the person ( is that you? ) is fading away. Gets a 10 from me and added to favorites.', '2006-06-19 17:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529345, 348596, 45003, '<td valign="top">This is just awesome. Definetely desolation to me.</td>', 'This is just awesome. Definetely desolation to me.', '2006-06-19 17:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529361, 349530, 45003, '<td valign="top">Man, this one touches my soul.. I''ve been looking at it for several minutes. I''m an orphan and I feel that you expressed the pain and grief extremely well. <br/> <br/>Gets a 10 from me and added to favorites.</td>', 'Man, this one touches my soul.. I''ve been looking at it for several minutes. I''m an orphan and I feel that you expressed the pain and grief extremely well.  Gets a 10 from me and added to favorites.', '2006-06-19 17:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529362, 349203, 52439, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot.', '2006-06-19 17:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529364, 349218, 52439, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and quite well executed, but it seems asthough it''s been darkened in PP and that gives it slightly odd hue on the models face mostly.</td>', 'Nice idea, and quite well executed, but it seems asthough it''s been darkened in PP and that gives it slightly odd hue on the models face mostly.', '2006-06-19 17:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529365, 349273, 51538, '<td valign="top">Graffiti, wire, signs of decay all add up to desolation and are a depressing sight whereever seen.  For this photo, I think we need some sort of prop.  It''s ironic that we most likely need some interest in a photo of desolation!  Seems contra to what the subject is.  Perhaps an old broken child''s toy lying in the dust.</td>', 'Graffiti, wire, signs of decay all add up to desolation and are a depressing sight whereever seen.  For this photo, I think we need some sort of prop.  It''s ironic that we most likely need some interest in a photo of desolation!  Seems contra to what the subject is.  Perhaps an old broken child''s toy lying in the dust.', '2006-06-19 17:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529366, 349543, 52439, '<td valign="top">Great shot, brilliant crop.</td>', 'Great shot, brilliant crop.', '2006-06-19 17:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2529367, 349533, 21915, '<td valign="top">A great shot! but I don''t see desolation, but I do like this a lot but I will have to say DMC</td>', 'A great shot! but I don''t see desolation, but I do like this a lot but I will have to say DMC', '2006-06-19 17:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
