(2529580, 349168, 10848, '<td valign="top">These child shots really tug at the heart strings. This is so sad. Like the emptiness of the long passageway. Great image. 9</td>', 'These child shots really tug at the heart strings. This is so sad. Like the emptiness of the long passageway. Great image. 9', '2006-06-19 19:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
