(2530258, 349248, 58947, '<td valign="top">I love this pic, and scored it highly - but my only nit is that this guy looks a bit too well dressed to be in such a setting. Though, it does kind of add to the enigma of the image: what is such a well dressed man doing with his head in his hands in such a wretched place? Great pic. Love the tones and textures.</td>', 'I love this pic, and scored it highly - but my only nit is that this guy looks a bit too well dressed to be in such a setting. Though, it does kind of add to the enigma of the image: what is such a well dressed man doing with his head in his hands in such a wretched place? Great pic. Love the tones and textures.', '2006-06-19 22:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530260, 349465, 58947, '<td valign="top">I love this. He reminds me of the junkies in Holland, shooting up in any available corner of the city, getting a little white heat in their otherwise cold and desolate urban subterranea. Well done!</td>', 'I love this. He reminds me of the junkies in Holland, shooting up in any available corner of the city, getting a little white heat in their otherwise cold and desolate urban subterranea. Well done!', '2006-06-19 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530263, 349023, 58947, '<td valign="top">Wow, the blue adds to the feeling of cold death, and almost of ashes. While I usually cringe and foam at the mouth at the American flag and it''s worship, I''ve still given you a 10. Beautiful picture. Very sad.</td>', 'Wow, the blue adds to the feeling of cold death, and almost of ashes. While I usually cringe and foam at the mouth at the American flag and it''s worship, I''ve still given you a 10. Beautiful picture. Very sad.', '2006-06-19 22:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
