(2530413, 349122, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww.   How sad!  Nice photo for this challenge.   It does raise a desolate feeling in my heart even thinking about a beautiful little girl like her being abandoned.</td>', 'Awwwwww.   How sad!  Nice photo for this challenge.   It does raise a desolate feeling in my heart even thinking about a beautiful little girl like her being abandoned.', '2006-06-19 23:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
