(2530792, 349133, 22301, '<td valign="top">interesting photo, all the horizontals but it would be nice to have the walls come out of the frame be even, or maybe shoot from a lower angle so that walls fill the entire frame. I like the depth of field and lines running through the picture leading to the wall in the back</td>', 'interesting photo, all the horizontals but it would be nice to have the walls come out of the frame be even, or maybe shoot from a lower angle so that walls fill the entire frame. I like the depth of field and lines running through the picture leading to the wall in the back', '2006-06-20 01:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
