(2530795, 349486, 59740, '<td valign="top">Blurred, confusing</td>', 'Blurred, confusing', '2006-06-20 01:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530798, 349495, 59740, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of sepia toning. Nice composition. What is it?</td>', 'Excellent use of sepia toning. Nice composition. What is it?', '2006-06-20 01:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530802, 348572, 59740, '<td valign="top">Does not say desolation to me.</td>', 'Does not say desolation to me.', '2006-06-20 01:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530803, 349248, 22301, '<td valign="top">nice emotion and location, and get a bonus point for the chuck taylors, 8</td>', 'nice emotion and location, and get a bonus point for the chuck taylors, 8', '2006-06-20 01:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530804, 348460, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of subject. Looks like the focus is kind of off though. Possibly the camera was too close to subject? Inside the minimum focus distance. Or perhaps camera shake from being hand held and lo light?</td>', 'Interesting choice of subject. Looks like the focus is kind of off though. Possibly the camera was too close to subject? Inside the minimum focus distance. Or perhaps camera shake from being hand held and lo light?', '2006-06-20 01:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530805, 349611, 59740, '<td valign="top">Blurred, blocked shadows, uninteresting sky occupies much of the photo. Good idea but could have been better executed</td>', 'Blurred, blocked shadows, uninteresting sky occupies much of the photo. Good idea but could have been better executed', '2006-06-20 01:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530807, 348835, 59740, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Hardly desolate.</td>', 'Beautiful. Hardly desolate.', '2006-06-20 01:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530810, 349231, 59740, '<td valign="top">Has the makings of a great picture. I would have zoomed or cropped in closer on the homeless person.</td>', 'Has the makings of a great picture. I would have zoomed or cropped in closer on the homeless person.', '2006-06-20 02:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530815, 348761, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I love foggy, misty shots. Never seem to find the right occurence to try one myself. A good sound composition, with a nice use of leading lines. I like how the lamp post is tall and grandeur, as if standing sentinel over it''s surroundings. The line of lamps like that, with the line of the curb, and the fog, makes me think of ''cold war'' type things. Like the border walls, or no man''s land, dmz type of thing, and guards posted along the line. Nice job.</td>', 'Very cool shot. I love foggy, misty shots. Never seem to find the right occurence to try one myself. A good sound composition, with a nice use of leading lines. I like how the lamp post is tall and grandeur, as if standing sentinel over it''s surroundings. The line of lamps like that, with the line of the curb, and the fog, makes me think of ''cold war'' type things. Like the border walls, or no man''s land, dmz type of thing, and guards posted along the line. Nice job.', '2006-06-20 02:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530817, 349401, 59740, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell that this is a desolated beach. A wider lens would have said it better.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell that this is a desolated beach. A wider lens would have said it better.', '2006-06-20 02:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530819, 349282, 22301, '<td valign="top">good capture and like the expression of the dog, and the literal use of the title is good. I would have maybe gone with a different duotone choice or black and white, it is alittle too purple. I dont feel desolation without the title, but since the description of the challenge is what it means to you I am not judging on those grounds, just my thoughts</td>', 'good capture and like the expression of the dog, and the literal use of the title is good. I would have maybe gone with a different duotone choice or black and white, it is alittle too purple. I dont feel desolation without the title, but since the description of the challenge is what it means to you I am not judging on those grounds, just my thoughts', '2006-06-20 02:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530821, 349322, 59740, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell what this is.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell what this is.', '2006-06-20 02:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530823, 348828, 59740, '<td valign="top">How do we know other than from the caption.</td>', 'How do we know other than from the caption.', '2006-06-20 02:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530825, 349380, 59740, '<td valign="top">Would have been even better if not centered.</td>', 'Would have been even better if not centered.', '2006-06-20 02:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530827, 348023, 22301, '<td valign="top">excellent, a very powerful image, and I can see intensity in the eyes and I like how it forces the viewer to feel the emotion of the girl, great job. 10</td>', 'excellent, a very powerful image, and I can see intensity in the eyes and I like how it forces the viewer to feel the emotion of the girl, great job. 10', '2006-06-20 02:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530829, 348850, 59740, '<td valign="top">Great idea but the hand looks too healthy!</td>', 'Great idea but the hand looks too healthy!', '2006-06-20 02:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530841, 349312, 59740, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I would like to see a center of interest.</td>', 'Good idea. I would like to see a center of interest.', '2006-06-20 02:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530843, 349517, 59740, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2006-06-20 02:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530845, 349503, 19831, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject, that seems to have good potential. I''m feeling that this isn''t the strongest presentation in this shot though. The point of view isn''t very stimulating, it appears as if you came across this stump, and pointed the camera down and took a shot. Perhaps getting down low, or finding a dramatic angle, something other than a typical view you would see could be better. I think you may have also fallen into a territory where the shot is wanting either more or less. Less meaning, get closer in, show the viewer just the wood and broken pieces, really key in on the subject. Or more being, if the shot is going to include some of the surrounding scene, show enough to add context, enough to use some space to position the stump in the frame on a thirds line, or out of center, try to give some dynamics to the composition, things along that line. I''m also thinking that a little tweaking in editing could make for an improvement also. Maybe a little levels or curves adj, strengthen the tonal range, and some usm to get a little sharpness.</td>', 'An interesting subject, that seems to have good potential. I''m feeling that this isn''t the strongest presentation in this shot though. The point of view isn''t very stimulating, it appears as if you came across this stump, and pointed the camera down and took a shot. Perhaps getting down low, or finding a dramatic angle, something other than a typical view you would see could be better. I think you may have also fallen into a territory where the shot is wanting either more or less. Less meaning, get closer in, show the viewer just the wood and broken pieces, really key in on the subject. Or more being, if the shot is going to include some of the surrounding scene, show enough to add context, enough to use some space to position the stump in the frame on a thirds line, or out of center, try to give some dynamics to the composition, things along that line. I''m also thinking that a little tweaking in editing could make for an improvement also. Maybe a little levels or curves adj, strengthen the tonal range, and some usm to get a little sharpness.', '2006-06-20 02:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530848, 349344, 59740, '<td valign="top">Washed out highlights and oversaturated.</td>', 'Washed out highlights and oversaturated.', '2006-06-20 02:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530852, 349349, 59740, '<td valign="top">Interesting design but I can''t tell what it is?</td>', 'Interesting design but I can''t tell what it is?', '2006-06-20 02:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530859, 349465, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the shot. Definitely works for the challenge for me. Of course I don''t know if this is a set up shot with a model, or you actually found this person there, but I wish the person were a little more detectable. I didn''t see him at first. Took a few seconds. Some quick voters may miss it altogether. Of course, only so much you can do if you found this person here :-). Perhaps positiioning him a little differently, a spot (like slightly to the left) where there is just a touch more light. Or even changing the point of view/angle/framing of the shot, to place him in a more solid, prominent position in the composition.</td>', 'Great idea for the shot. Definitely works for the challenge for me. Of course I don''t know if this is a set up shot with a model, or you actually found this person there, but I wish the person were a little more detectable. I didn''t see him at first. Took a few seconds. Some quick voters may miss it altogether. Of course, only so much you can do if you found this person here :-). Perhaps positiioning him a little differently, a spot (like slightly to the left) where there is just a touch more light. Or even changing the point of view/angle/framing of the shot, to place him in a more solid, prominent position in the composition.', '2006-06-20 02:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2530869, 349147, 19831, '<td valign="top">Interesting approach to the challenge. Works for me, I get the idea. I think including the trees and stuff show enough context to help convey the concept. The title, to me helps too, without being so much to sound like ''shoehorning''. Good job.</td>', 'Interesting approach to the challenge. Works for me, I get the idea. I think including the trees and stuff show enough context to help convey the concept. The title, to me helps too, without being so much to sound like ''shoehorning''. Good job.', '2006-06-20 02:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
