(2530947, 348101, 44453, '<td valign="top">I dont think that puttng the horizon in the middle of the frame helps your composition.  If the carpet is the focus of the photo then it should take up most of the frame and the sky one third or less.  The colour and tones are also quite flat, some more post-processing is required.</td>', 'I dont think that puttng the horizon in the middle of the frame helps your composition.  If the carpet is the focus of the photo then it should take up most of the frame and the sky one third or less.  The colour and tones are also quite flat, some more post-processing is required.', '2006-06-20 03:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
