(2531294, 349210, 44453, '<td valign="top">It''s good to see lots of colours in this challenge, I was afraid that I would be voting on 198 dreary black and white photos.  This really invokes desolation to me - well done.  I would have moved the tree a bit more to the left, it feels like it''s not sure if it wants to be a centred composition or a rule of thirds...</td>', 'It''s good to see lots of colours in this challenge, I was afraid that I would be voting on 198 dreary black and white photos.  This really invokes desolation to me - well done.  I would have moved the tree a bit more to the left, it feels like it''s not sure if it wants to be a centred composition or a rule of thirds...', '2006-06-20 08:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
