(2531369, 348101, 52925, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but this shot isn''t very good. You could probably enhance it by bumping the contrast/saturation a bit, but probably more dramatically by adding something of interest in your photo. Right now it lacks depth and a focal point. A few shadows here and there could make it more interesting, but why not put a model in somewhere? You could even pose yourself.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but this shot isn''t very good. You could probably enhance it by bumping the contrast/saturation a bit, but probably more dramatically by adding something of interest in your photo. Right now it lacks depth and a focal point. A few shadows here and there could make it more interesting, but why not put a model in somewhere? You could even pose yourself.', '2006-06-20 09:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2531370, 347421, 44453, '<td valign="top">a bit over saturated</td>', 'a bit over saturated', '2006-06-20 09:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2531372, 349503, 52925, '<td valign="top">This photo could be much more interesting if you took it from a lower angle, and/or if the subkect wasn''t centered. It could also use a bit more contrast. The log is sort of going up in the background.</td>', 'This photo could be much more interesting if you took it from a lower angle, and/or if the subkect wasn''t centered. It could also use a bit more contrast. The log is sort of going up in the background.', '2006-06-20 09:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2531374, 349598, 44453, '<td valign="top">tones are a bit flat, need a bit more processing to make this scene really work</td>', 'tones are a bit flat, need a bit more processing to make this scene really work', '2006-06-20 09:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2531375, 348162, 52925, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, but this photo could be more interesting if you added some DoF.</td>', 'Nice colors, but this photo could be more interesting if you added some DoF.', '2006-06-20 09:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2531377, 348416, 52925, '<td valign="top">Not much of interest here, and too little contrast. This tight crop doesn''t really work here either.</td>', 'Not much of interest here, and too little contrast. This tight crop doesn''t really work here either.', '2006-06-20 09:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2531384, 349592, 52925, '<td valign="top">This could''ve been a nice photo if it got away from that ''snapshot'' feel. It does not appear to have had much work in it, and that hurts it. Next time, try a different angle; the left part of the picture (sky and trees) do not add anything really, and could''ve been left out of the photo entirely.</td>', 'This could''ve been a nice photo if it got away from that ''snapshot'' feel. It does not appear to have had much work in it, and that hurts it. Next time, try a different angle; the left part of the picture (sky and trees) do not add anything really, and could''ve been left out of the photo entirely.', '2006-06-20 09:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2531386, 349402, 52925, '<td valign="top">A bit dull and uninspired. Could do with more contrasting colors and a more interesting angle.</td>', 'A bit dull and uninspired. Could do with more contrasting colors and a more interesting angle.', '2006-06-20 09:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2531387, 348854, 52925, '<td valign="top">Not really an inspired shot. The empty wall on the right does not add anything to the picture. Having a model sitting alone in the corner would convey your idea of desolation better than just a cup. The lighting could be more dramatic.</td>', 'Not really an inspired shot. The empty wall on the right does not add anything to the picture. Having a model sitting alone in the corner would convey your idea of desolation better than just a cup. The lighting could be more dramatic.', '2006-06-20 09:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2531392, 348460, 52925, '<td valign="top">Sad, certainly, and probably very desolate, but the photo is very flat and uninteresting. Also, with a shot like this you would want your main subject to be in crisp focus, but it appears the focus is here a few centimeters off. Giving it a more interestin crop could''ve helped immensely, you don''t really need so much dirt arounf the wings.</td>', 'Sad, certainly, and probably very desolate, but the photo is very flat and uninteresting. Also, with a shot like this you would want your main subject to be in crisp focus, but it appears the focus is here a few centimeters off. Giving it a more interestin crop could''ve helped immensely, you don''t really need so much dirt arounf the wings.', '2006-06-20 09:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2531394, 348423, 44453, '<td valign="top">maybe this would work better with a bit less sky?</td>', 'maybe this would work better with a bit less sky?', '2006-06-20 09:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
