(2532359, 348896, 51538, '<td valign="top">A scruffy little bear he is and the right character for desolation.  I would have removed his sign and taken him outside (away from those heathen lights) and set him up in a lonely place looking out for himself.</td>', 'A scruffy little bear he is and the right character for desolation.  I would have removed his sign and taken him outside (away from those heathen lights) and set him up in a lonely place looking out for himself.', '2006-06-20 16:27:39.000000', NULL, 1);
