(2532368, 348839, 57519, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this fits the challenge, but, real funny...Now go get a ladder.</td>', 'Not sure how this fits the challenge, but, real funny...Now go get a ladder.', '2006-06-20 16:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532369, 349410, 51538, '<td valign="top">That prow rather pokes into my left eye, if you know what I mean.  Interesting location and colours.  Might be more desolate with less of the fertile green.</td>', 'That prow rather pokes into my left eye, if you know what I mean.  Interesting location and colours.  Might be more desolate with less of the fertile green.', '2006-06-20 16:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532390, 349568, 50571, '<td valign="top">overexposed above the door, nice shot though</td>', 'overexposed above the door, nice shot though', '2006-06-20 16:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532391, 349543, 50571, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2006-06-20 16:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532396, 348511, 50571, '<td valign="top">beautiful model, yet i don''t see the desolation</td>', 'beautiful model, yet i don''t see the desolation', '2006-06-20 16:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532398, 347421, 50571, '<td valign="top">a little too much contrast</td>', 'a little too much contrast', '2006-06-20 16:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532402, 348853, 50571, '<td valign="top">grammer!</td>', 'grammer!', '2006-06-20 16:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532404, 348864, 57726, '<td valign="top">Striking image!  A little grainy, but it adds to the effect.</td>', 'Striking image!  A little grainy, but it adds to the effect.', '2006-06-20 16:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532414, 349365, 51538, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene.</td>', 'Pretty scene.', '2006-06-20 16:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532416, 349345, 51538, '<td valign="top">That''s a long, long coastline you''ve fitted down the lens.  Quite remarkable really and completely takes my mind off the challenge subject.  Desolation or not?  Yes, I think it is.</td>', 'That''s a long, long coastline you''ve fitted down the lens.  Quite remarkable really and completely takes my mind off the challenge subject.  Desolation or not?  Yes, I think it is.', '2006-06-20 16:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532423, 348755, 51538, '<td valign="top">I sort of feel everytime I look at a title in this challenge, if it is not a word that alludes to or implies desolation it is then more the word chosen (in your case wretchedness) than desolation.  But in your case I think this image does encompass desolation of a sort.  Perhaps the desolation of spirit that you are depciting is diluted too much in the space around the human.  Somehow a little closer in with selective inclusion of burned out highlights or whatever would emphasize the desolate feeling.</td>', 'I sort of feel everytime I look at a title in this challenge, if it is not a word that alludes to or implies desolation it is then more the word chosen (in your case wretchedness) than desolation.  But in your case I think this image does encompass desolation of a sort.  Perhaps the desolation of spirit that you are depciting is diluted too much in the space around the human.  Somehow a little closer in with selective inclusion of burned out highlights or whatever would emphasize the desolate feeling.', '2006-06-20 17:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532425, 349204, 51538, '<td valign="top">A wondeful location for photos.  A bit desolate too.</td>', 'A wondeful location for photos.  A bit desolate too.', '2006-06-20 17:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532427, 348898, 51538, '<td valign="top">A grand natural drama and more than a little desolate.</td>', 'A grand natural drama and more than a little desolate.', '2006-06-20 17:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532435, 348511, 51538, '<td valign="top">Vulnerable, delicate and attractive is what comes to mind first.  Possibly a desolate thought running through her mind.</td>', 'Vulnerable, delicate and attractive is what comes to mind first.  Possibly a desolate thought running through her mind.', '2006-06-20 17:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532464, 349195, 50674, '<td valign="top">Extremely strong photograph. Colours are good, composition too. I do hope it does well.</td>', 'Extremely strong photograph. Colours are good, composition too. I do hope it does well.', '2006-06-20 17:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532555, 349359, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Subject matter has high interest and it qualifies as desolate. It looks a bit overly smooth in the shadow area to me.</td>', 'Very nice. Subject matter has high interest and it qualifies as desolate. It looks a bit overly smooth in the shadow area to me.', '2006-06-20 18:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532558, 348821, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. It''s a bit contrasty for me---I''d like to see more detail in the shadow areas.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. It''s a bit contrasty for me---I''d like to see more detail in the shadow areas.', '2006-06-20 18:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532567, 349320, 7322, '<td valign="top">Intersting subject matter and qualifies as desolate. I''m not excited by this though. Maybe a more dramatic angle highlighting a segment of the building rather than this rather straightforward point of view? I think if there were some sort of figure in the foreground, a dog, or cat perhaps, or maybe some abandoned object, this view would work more for me. The expanse of patchy grass doesn''t make enough of an impact to me.</td>', 'Intersting subject matter and qualifies as desolate. I''m not excited by this though. Maybe a more dramatic angle highlighting a segment of the building rather than this rather straightforward point of view? I think if there were some sort of figure in the foreground, a dog, or cat perhaps, or maybe some abandoned object, this view would work more for me. The expanse of patchy grass doesn''t make enough of an impact to me.', '2006-06-20 18:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532570, 349436, 7322, '<td valign="top">Maybe if this were taken at a different time of day I would get the sense of desolation. A more dramatic point of view would also help. This scene is just peaceful to me---a nice view, dappled shade, and a nice seat. The fact that the bench is empty isn''t enough to evoke a sense of desolation in me.</td>', 'Maybe if this were taken at a different time of day I would get the sense of desolation. A more dramatic point of view would also help. This scene is just peaceful to me---a nice view, dappled shade, and a nice seat. The fact that the bench is empty isn''t enough to evoke a sense of desolation in me.', '2006-06-20 18:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532579, 349203, 60073, '<td valign="top">why the frame?? good picture - take away the frame.</td>', 'why the frame?? good picture - take away the frame.', '2006-06-20 18:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532586, 348854, 7322, '<td valign="top">this photo doesn''t give me much to think about or look at. These two objects don''t evoke any kind of feeling or reaction in me at all. The lighting is good but only in the sense that it reveals the objects with clarity but not in a way that creates a mood of desolation or loneliness to me.</td>', 'this photo doesn''t give me much to think about or look at. These two objects don''t evoke any kind of feeling or reaction in me at all. The lighting is good but only in the sense that it reveals the objects with clarity but not in a way that creates a mood of desolation or loneliness to me.', '2006-06-20 18:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532593, 347943, 7322, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm....I like the photo and it is obviously well-done. I''m not sure if desolation is the word I think of (or anything similar---isolation, despair,abandonment). While the figure is solitary, the still water, sunset, and overall gorgeous view make me envy him. Solitude isn''t the same as desolation. This looks like peaceful solitude to me.</td>', 'Hmmmm....I like the photo and it is obviously well-done. I''m not sure if desolation is the word I think of (or anything similar---isolation, despair,abandonment). While the figure is solitary, the still water, sunset, and overall gorgeous view make me envy him. Solitude isn''t the same as desolation. This looks like peaceful solitude to me.', '2006-06-20 18:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532600, 348918, 60073, '<td valign="top">great photo - love the set-up - i love the reflection</td>', 'great photo - love the set-up - i love the reflection', '2006-06-20 18:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532662, 349049, 14211, '<td valign="top">just like it.....</td>', 'just like it.....', '2006-06-20 19:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532666, 348270, 59974, '<td valign="top">C''est ta plus belle photo à date. Wow!! C''est fantastique.  Bravo!</td>', 'C''est ta plus belle photo à date. Wow!! C''est fantastique.  Bravo!', '2006-06-20 19:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532679, 349428, 14211, '<td valign="top">I just love the Angel series.....they should make a children`s book...then a movie(&amp; I know the PERFECT actress).</td>', 'I just love the Angel series.....they should make a children`s book...then a movie(& I know the PERFECT actress).', '2006-06-20 19:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532681, 349123, 59974, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting.</td>', 'Love the lighting.', '2006-06-20 19:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
