(2532743, 349428, 32030, '<td valign="top">The expression on her face is great.</td>', 'The expression on her face is great.', '2006-06-20 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532746, 349517, 32030, '<td valign="top">Great image...I like the PP</td>', 'Great image...I like the PP', '2006-06-20 19:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532752, 349589, 32030, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Maybe it would be a bit better with a tighter crop...but then the lighting wouldn''t look as dramatic.  An excellent example of a shot where the right caption set the tone and feel of the shot, at least IMHO</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Maybe it would be a bit better with a tighter crop...but then the lighting wouldn''t look as dramatic.  An excellent example of a shot where the right caption set the tone and feel of the shot, at least IMHO', '2006-06-20 19:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532755, 347277, 32030, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast  in this image...the center of interest (the weed) is just a little too busy</td>', 'I like the contrast  in this image...the center of interest (the weed) is just a little too busy', '2006-06-20 19:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532756, 349499, 57519, '<td valign="top">Looks like he was beat up.</td>', 'Looks like he was beat up.', '2006-06-20 19:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532760, 349023, 32030, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, but I am not sold on the blue tone.  I don''t mind it, I just think I would prefer it in B&amp;W.  Really like the soft feel though</td>', 'I really like this image, but I am not sold on the blue tone.  I don''t mind it, I just think I would prefer it in B&W.  Really like the soft feel though', '2006-06-20 19:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532761, 349203, 57519, '<td valign="top">I find that frame kind of distracting.</td>', 'I find that frame kind of distracting.', '2006-06-20 19:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532765, 347943, 57519, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2006-06-20 19:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532767, 349024, 32030, '<td valign="top">This just makes me want to cry!  Of course maybe she just ran into a door or something...but the feel of the image, and the caption, make me think abuse.  The little smile is perfect.  A tad more in focus would improve it IMHO</td>', 'This just makes me want to cry!  Of course maybe she just ran into a door or something...but the feel of the image, and the caption, make me think abuse.  The little smile is perfect.  A tad more in focus would improve it IMHO', '2006-06-20 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532768, 348596, 32030, '<td valign="top">I love the tones and the contrast.</td>', 'I love the tones and the contrast.', '2006-06-20 19:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532774, 349296, 32030, '<td valign="top">I like this image, the high contrast really adds intrest.  I also like the effect that was applied to the background (I hope it is an effect) almost looks painted.  Very nice</td>', 'I like this image, the high contrast really adds intrest.  I also like the effect that was applied to the background (I hope it is an effect) almost looks painted.  Very nice', '2006-06-20 19:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532777, 349127, 32030, '<td valign="top">I like the drama of this image...only change...it is hard to tell if model is happy or sad and for desolation I am assuming she is sad.</td>', 'I like the drama of this image...only change...it is hard to tell if model is happy or sad and for desolation I am assuming she is sad.', '2006-06-20 19:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532778, 349611, 32030, '<td valign="top">I like the dark contrast.  IMHO this darkness makes it fit the challenge better.</td>', 'I like the dark contrast.  IMHO this darkness makes it fit the challenge better.', '2006-06-20 19:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532790, 349052, 32030, '<td valign="top">Love the rocks</td>', 'Love the rocks', '2006-06-20 19:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532796, 349530, 32030, '<td valign="top">OK, so it''s not pretty...but it is a good image, and it does fit the challenge.  I think I would crop out a bit more of the foreground.  Contrast is good, lighting is good. Bumping score to 9</td>', 'OK, so it''s not pretty...but it is a good image, and it does fit the challenge.  I think I would crop out a bit more of the foreground.  Contrast is good, lighting is good. Bumping score to 9', '2006-06-20 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532797, 349023, 55330, '<td valign="top">Hey Smile nice shot, the blue in this lends to a great mood</td>', 'Hey Smile nice shot, the blue in this lends to a great mood', '2006-06-20 19:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532799, 349465, 32030, '<td valign="top">I really like the angle on this...really fits the challenge.  Only suggestion...take away some of the blue cast in the colors. 8</td>', 'I really like the angle on this...really fits the challenge.  Only suggestion...take away some of the blue cast in the colors. 8', '2006-06-20 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532802, 349055, 32030, '<td valign="top">I like this image, but the PP is just a tad overdone for my taste.  If you are implying homelessness of "down on your luck" then IMHO the subject should be a bit dirtier. 8</td>', 'I like this image, but the PP is just a tad overdone for my taste.  If you are implying homelessness of "down on your luck" then IMHO the subject should be a bit dirtier. 8', '2006-06-20 19:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
