(2532834, 349486, 42100, '<td valign="top">Crisp, crisp detail in the flower head and the fade away focus in the withered petals looks awesome.  Strong comp to boot!  Hmmm...now if I could only figure out who created this masterpiece?</td>', 'Crisp, crisp detail in the flower head and the fade away focus in the withered petals looks awesome.  Strong comp to boot!  Hmmm...now if I could only figure out who created this masterpiece?', '2006-06-20 20:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
