(2539522, 349420, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the comp. tones are nice but a bit more contrast is needed and different lighting to keep from over exposing the chrome part of the pay phone. I try to set my focus on the chrome, move the lens to get the comp I''m looking for and then adjust the brightness in PS. I''ve had some success shooting chrome this way.</td>', 'I like the idea and the comp. tones are nice but a bit more contrast is needed and different lighting to keep from over exposing the chrome part of the pay phone. I try to set my focus on the chrome, move the lens to get the comp I''m looking for and then adjust the brightness in PS. I''ve had some success shooting chrome this way.', '2006-06-22 01:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
