(2540654, 349586, 38032, '<td valign="top">umbrellas typically do well in challenges ... I should know :] ... anyway, in this case I think the new-looking umbrella erases much of the desolate feeling here.  The scene is excellent and having a person there is fine ... maybe an umbrella that''s been beat up would work better here. 6</td>', 'umbrellas typically do well in challenges ... I should know :] ... anyway, in this case I think the new-looking umbrella erases much of the desolate feeling here.  The scene is excellent and having a person there is fine ... maybe an umbrella that''s been beat up would work better here. 6', '2006-06-22 11:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
