(2542845, 347874, 51538, '<td valign="top">The right hand window makes this image.  Blue sky and cloud, like a far away dream to the man on the steps.  Him in his own depressing world of troubles; the real world in all its divine glory only a lift of the head away.  Very good juxtaposition if one sits and thinks a little.  I missed it first time - lucky I cam back...</td>', 'The right hand window makes this image.  Blue sky and cloud, like a far away dream to the man on the steps.  Him in his own depressing world of troubles; the real world in all its divine glory only a lift of the head away.  Very good juxtaposition if one sits and thinks a little.  I missed it first time - lucky I cam back...', '2006-06-22 22:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
