(2542849, 349296, 51538, '<td valign="top">Good photo depiction of desolation.  Perhaps the best I have seen so far.  It also evokes the feeling of desolation.</td>', 'Good photo depiction of desolation.  Perhaps the best I have seen so far.  It also evokes the feeling of desolation.', '2006-06-22 22:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2542852, 349590, 51538, '<td valign="top">Sanitized arty desolation.  I say this after seeing a couple - and there are very, very few photos in this challenge which either depict or evoke sights or feelings of desolation.  A chained dog in a bad way, a girl pining for a dead mother - these are real heart-rending images of desolation which evoke feeling.  So you can understand why I say your image is sanitized.  But it is still an excellent photo very pleasing to look at. 8.</td>', 'Sanitized arty desolation.  I say this after seeing a couple - and there are very, very few photos in this challenge which either depict or evoke sights or feelings of desolation.  A chained dog in a bad way, a girl pining for a dead mother - these are real heart-rending images of desolation which evoke feeling.  So you can understand why I say your image is sanitized.  But it is still an excellent photo very pleasing to look at. 8.', '2006-06-22 22:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2542853, 349598, 51538, '<td valign="top">This looks like the type of desolation left by open-strip mining.  The b/w or is it duotone enhances that feeling of malnourished landscape.</td>', 'This looks like the type of desolation left by open-strip mining.  The b/w or is it duotone enhances that feeling of malnourished landscape.', '2006-06-22 22:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
