(2542855, 348262, 51538, '<td valign="top">The clouds make a nice backdrop to the sculpture.  The effect of the sculpture is to evoke a sense of desolation and your framing it with clouds has enhanced that feeling.</td>', 'The clouds make a nice backdrop to the sculpture.  The effect of the sculpture is to evoke a sense of desolation and your framing it with clouds has enhanced that feeling.', '2006-06-22 22:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
