(2543535, 349533, 42013, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail and sharpness.  Can you say GREEN?</td>', 'Lovely detail and sharpness.  Can you say GREEN?', '2006-06-23 02:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543537, 347916, 42013, '<td valign="top">Splendid contrast, color, and a great feeling of nothingness.  Good luck.</td>', 'Splendid contrast, color, and a great feeling of nothingness.  Good luck.', '2006-06-23 02:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543542, 348596, 42013, '<td valign="top">ONe of the most striking rock formations in the american SW.  Lovely job with your contrast and toning.  The texture of the old fence is perfect. And this part of NM is certainly desolate.</td>', 'ONe of the most striking rock formations in the american SW.  Lovely job with your contrast and toning.  The texture of the old fence is perfect. And this part of NM is certainly desolate.', '2006-06-23 02:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543617, 347277, 53964, '<td valign="top">The blues are a little strong for my liking, find my eye continually being drawn back toward the sky and hill when I want to concentrate more on the foreground, but otherwise I really like the shot. It definitely conveys desolation and I like the harsh light and strong saturation of the fence and branches.</td>', 'The blues are a little strong for my liking, find my eye continually being drawn back toward the sky and hill when I want to concentrate more on the foreground, but otherwise I really like the shot. It definitely conveys desolation and I like the harsh light and strong saturation of the fence and branches.', '2006-06-23 02:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543620, 349168, 42013, '<td valign="top">Touching and technicaly superb.</td>', 'Touching and technicaly superb.', '2006-06-23 02:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543621, 348931, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Nice composition with a title that enhances.</td>', 'I like it.  Nice composition with a title that enhances.', '2006-06-23 02:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543623, 349481, 42013, '<td valign="top">Creative for sure!</td>', 'Creative for sure!', '2006-06-23 02:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543625, 346905, 53964, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I find the doorknob and more ornate door at odds with the barren feel that the smooth walls and stark lines give the rest. Possibly a bit tighter crop there?  It''s a very effective shot :)</td>', 'I like this, but I find the doorknob and more ornate door at odds with the barren feel that the smooth walls and stark lines give the rest. Possibly a bit tighter crop there?  It''s a very effective shot :)', '2006-06-23 02:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543629, 349075, 42013, '<td valign="top">A beautiful mountain.  Mt Shasta maybe???  Anyway, pic is a little grainy, check iso setting on your camera. Something higher than 400 could be the culprit.  Square crop is nice although border takes away from the pic IMHO</td>', 'A beautiful mountain.  Mt Shasta maybe???  Anyway, pic is a little grainy, check iso setting on your camera. Something higher than 400 could be the culprit.  Square crop is nice although border takes away from the pic IMHO', '2006-06-23 02:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543634, 349284, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice composition iwth the green hills, brown fields and the old barn just catching the light.</td>', 'Nice composition iwth the green hills, brown fields and the old barn just catching the light.', '2006-06-23 02:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543639, 348569, 42013, '<td valign="top">FWIW~  there is a lot going on in this pic, maybe too much to effectively capture the viewers attention and make them feel the desolation.  I think for this pic i would have recommended some good old fashion fence jumping ;0</td>', 'FWIW~  there is a lot going on in this pic, maybe too much to effectively capture the viewers attention and make them feel the desolation.  I think for this pic i would have recommended some good old fashion fence jumping ;0', '2006-06-23 02:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543640, 349410, 42013, '<td valign="top">Perspective seems a little forced and the vibrant colors dont feel as desolate as more muted colors might.  JMO.  I would like to see a little more context for the shipwreck.</td>', 'Perspective seems a little forced and the vibrant colors dont feel as desolate as more muted colors might.  JMO.  I would like to see a little more context for the shipwreck.', '2006-06-23 02:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543641, 349380, 42013, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  HOrizon seems a bit skewed. BW is appropriate and i like your title.</td>', 'Good subject.  HOrizon seems a bit skewed. BW is appropriate and i like your title.', '2006-06-23 02:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543643, 348342, 42013, '<td valign="top">Great BW tones and sharpness.  The trees counteract some of the effect of the stark, dry, riverbed.</td>', 'Great BW tones and sharpness.  The trees counteract some of the effect of the stark, dry, riverbed.', '2006-06-23 02:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543644, 349248, 42013, '<td valign="top">Nice framing. Looks like you and i had a similar idea :)</td>', 'Nice framing. Looks like you and i had a similar idea :)', '2006-06-23 02:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543647, 349499, 42013, '<td valign="top">Thats a great expression you captured on this dog''s face.  His fur and the grass are almost identical in texture and tone so it makes him disappear.</td>', 'Thats a great expression you captured on this dog''s face.  His fur and the grass are almost identical in texture and tone so it makes him disappear.', '2006-06-23 02:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543649, 349205, 42013, '<td valign="top">The horizon seems a bit tilted :)  See ongoing thread discussing this;)<br/> <br/>Good take on the challenge.</td>', 'The horizon seems a bit tilted :)  See ongoing thread discussing this;) Good take on the challenge.', '2006-06-23 02:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543651, 348637, 42013, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.</td>', 'Cool shot.', '2006-06-23 02:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543653, 349428, 42013, '<td valign="top">Another good use of this set of wings.</td>', 'Another good use of this set of wings.', '2006-06-23 02:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543655, 348090, 42013, '<td valign="top">A nice study of textures.</td>', 'A nice study of textures.', '2006-06-23 02:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543656, 348171, 42013, '<td valign="top">Is it a person?  NOt sure i get the message but it does have a pretty desolate feel to it.</td>', 'Is it a person?  NOt sure i get the message but it does have a pretty desolate feel to it.', '2006-06-23 02:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543657, 349606, 42013, '<td valign="top">Crop about 20% off of the top and this pic is stronger!  I like the leading line in the concrete but just seems like there is too much ceiling.</td>', 'Crop about 20% off of the top and this pic is stronger!  I like the leading line in the concrete but just seems like there is too much ceiling.', '2006-06-23 02:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
