(2543659, 348850, 42013, '<td valign="top">Good concept. A little more space away from the hand might provide more impact.  JMHO</td>', 'Good concept. A little more space away from the hand might provide more impact.  JMHO', '2006-06-23 02:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543660, 349218, 42013, '<td valign="top">NIce PP, good pose</td>', 'NIce PP, good pose', '2006-06-23 02:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543661, 348511, 42013, '<td valign="top">Skillful use of available light.</td>', 'Skillful use of available light.', '2006-06-23 02:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543662, 348761, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2006-06-23 02:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543663, 349503, 53964, '<td valign="top">The lack of any shadow anywhere makes this very flat and two-dimensional. I know little about lighting effects but maybe others can offer some suggestions for bringing out the best in a subject like this :)</td>', 'The lack of any shadow anywhere makes this very flat and two-dimensional. I know little about lighting effects but maybe others can offer some suggestions for bringing out the best in a subject like this :)', '2006-06-23 02:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543664, 348393, 42013, '<td valign="top">isn''t that the truth?</td>', 'isn''t that the truth?', '2006-06-23 02:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543665, 348912, 42013, '<td valign="top">NOw thats not right??  Downright depressing I say!</td>', 'NOw thats not right??  Downright depressing I say!', '2006-06-23 02:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543666, 349307, 42013, '<td valign="top">A beaten path might indicate too many people for real desolation ;) That aside, good composition and your leading lines work well.</td>', 'A beaten path might indicate too many people for real desolation ;) That aside, good composition and your leading lines work well.', '2006-06-23 02:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543678, 349351, 42013, '<td valign="top">This shot has so much potential that i feel compelled to comment on why i am only giving it a below avg score(4).<br/> <br/>The composition, sky, leading lines, are all great. the contrast between the sand and the grassy dunes are also nice.  What bothers me greatly is the areas of severe blurring in the sand and around some of the drifwood. It looks like an overdose of neat image or maybe some overzealous cloning/healing.  Did you remove some sun bathers? "Just kidding" <br/> <br/>This is the kind of setting which might beg for a reshoot the next time you get some storm clouds.  Im'' sure you might get plenty of commments regarding the blurring, but i only intend my criticism to be constructive.  Cheers</td>', 'This shot has so much potential that i feel compelled to comment on why i am only giving it a below avg score(4). The composition, sky, leading lines, are all great. the contrast between the sand and the grassy dunes are also nice.  What bothers me greatly is the areas of severe blurring in the sand and around some of the drifwood. It looks like an overdose of neat image or maybe some overzealous cloning/healing.  Did you remove some sun bathers? "Just kidding"  This is the kind of setting which might beg for a reshoot the next time you get some storm clouds.  Im'' sure you might get plenty of commments regarding the blurring, but i only intend my criticism to be constructive.  Cheers', '2006-06-23 03:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543680, 349420, 42013, '<td valign="top">I like the concept.  Picture overall is a little flat in contrast but kudos to you for using negative space so well.</td>', 'I like the concept.  Picture overall is a little flat in contrast but kudos to you for using negative space so well.', '2006-06-23 03:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543682, 348991, 42013, '<td valign="top">The essence of desolation.</td>', 'The essence of desolation.', '2006-06-23 03:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543688, 348839, 42013, '<td valign="top">I just dont get the message here.  Sorry!</td>', 'I just dont get the message here.  Sorry!', '2006-06-23 03:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543689, 348460, 42013, '<td valign="top">Dial down your exposure.  The pic also seems blurry, maybe handheld zoom or digital zoon on a P&amp;S camera???</td>', 'Dial down your exposure.  The pic also seems blurry, maybe handheld zoom or digital zoon on a P&S camera???', '2006-06-23 03:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543691, 349344, 42013, '<td valign="top">Colors just a little too saturated to fit with the image.</td>', 'Colors just a little too saturated to fit with the image.', '2006-06-23 03:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543692, 349599, 42013, '<td valign="top">True, but too much civilization to really portray desolation. That aside, fantastic view!</td>', 'True, but too much civilization to really portray desolation. That aside, fantastic view!', '2006-06-23 03:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
