(2543703, 349570, 53964, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing any real focal point other than the water tower, but you couldn''t have meant that as your main subject or it wouldn''t be almost missed in the shot?  I''m not meaning to sound harsh, I''m merely explaining what I see as one reason you may not be scoring as well as you''d like :)</td>', 'I''m not seeing any real focal point other than the water tower, but you couldn''t have meant that as your main subject or it wouldn''t be almost missed in the shot?  I''m not meaning to sound harsh, I''m merely explaining what I see as one reason you may not be scoring as well as you''d like :)', '2006-06-23 03:10:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543723, 348460, 53964, '<td valign="top">A great find for this challenge, just a little weak on the technicals. Sharpness and contrast would have seen this score better, I think :)</td>', 'A great find for this challenge, just a little weak on the technicals. Sharpness and contrast would have seen this score better, I think :)', '2006-06-23 03:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543733, 349359, 53964, '<td valign="top">Such a dreamy, mystical feel. I can almost hear the clatter of horse hoofs and rattle of armour about to appear into the shot. The illusion would be stronger without the flagpole (or at least the flag, if you felt the whole thing might be too major an element?).  Very nice shot :)</td>', 'Such a dreamy, mystical feel. I can almost hear the clatter of horse hoofs and rattle of armour about to appear into the shot. The illusion would be stronger without the flagpole (or at least the flag, if you felt the whole thing might be too major an element?).  Very nice shot :)', '2006-06-23 03:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543761, 349052, 37893, '<td valign="top">This image just expresses so much! (10)</td>', 'This image just expresses so much! (10)', '2006-06-23 03:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543905, 349075, 35274, '<td valign="top">Wow! That''s amazing!</td>', 'Wow! That''s amazing!', '2006-06-23 04:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2543910, 348499, 35274, '<td valign="top">I think the high contrast really adds to this. How it hides the persons face in shadow. the selective desat on the tiny pink/red fower is also a nice touch.</td>', 'I think the high contrast really adds to this. How it hides the persons face in shadow. the selective desat on the tiny pink/red fower is also a nice touch.', '2006-06-23 04:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
