(2544912, 349500, 58947, '<td valign="top">Wow, carnage. <br/> <br/>Love the colours. The red chair ripped to shreds, the white couch stained and rotting, the new green looking healthy and innocent. Nature sure is dynamic, and this speaks volumes of the personal havoc, and resulting human desolation, at nature''s fury. Great pic.</td>', 'Wow, carnage.  Love the colours. The red chair ripped to shreds, the white couch stained and rotting, the new green looking healthy and innocent. Nature sure is dynamic, and this speaks volumes of the personal havoc, and resulting human desolation, at nature''s fury. Great pic.', '2006-06-23 12:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
