(2545580, 349309, 51538, '<td valign="top">Shunned, ignored, and despised all come to mind.  But desolation is further down the top-of-the-mind list.  An advertizing company exec would not say this is desolation, if he or she had contracted you to take a photo to depict or evoke feelings of desolation.  I would say it is a nice photo well composed, though. 8.</td>', 'Shunned, ignored, and despised all come to mind.  But desolation is further down the top-of-the-mind list.  An advertizing company exec would not say this is desolation, if he or she had contracted you to take a photo to depict or evoke feelings of desolation.  I would say it is a nice photo well composed, though. 8.', '2006-06-23 15:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
