(2545699, 349589, 18367, '<td valign="top">Some images truly do tell a story... and this is one of them.  <br/> <br/>You have managed to depict the dejection and loneliness associated with parental neglect.  The dejected mood of the child, replete with hunched shoulders, coupled with the ambience brought upon by the lights... all of these truly lend themselves to a feeling of "Desolation".<br/> <br/>Very well done, and well deserving of a high score.  Good luck to you.</td>', 'Some images truly do tell a story... and this is one of them.   You have managed to depict the dejection and loneliness associated with parental neglect.  The dejected mood of the child, replete with hunched shoulders, coupled with the ambience brought upon by the lights... all of these truly lend themselves to a feeling of "Desolation". Very well done, and well deserving of a high score.  Good luck to you.', '2006-06-23 16:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2545817, 348511, 38496, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.  Without the title, though, it''s hard to tell that she''s desolate.  It looks more like she''s just relaxing, pondering life.  There''s no real feeling of sadness to it.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.  Without the title, though, it''s hard to tell that she''s desolate.  It looks more like she''s just relaxing, pondering life.  There''s no real feeling of sadness to it.', '2006-06-23 17:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
