(2547320, 349226, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is such a Georgia O''Keefe picture, with extra fur. The addition of a living creature who seems to be at one with his surroundings the way Georgia wanted to be at one, adds a profound twist. 8.</td>', 'this is such a Georgia O''Keefe picture, with extra fur. The addition of a living creature who seems to be at one with his surroundings the way Georgia wanted to be at one, adds a profound twist. 8.', '2006-06-24 00:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
