(2547785, 348047, 38496, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot.  Initiallly I knocked it a bit because it doesn''t have a ''sad'' feeling.  It''s almost too pretty, and the water looks too inviting.  But looking at is closer, I see that the rocks are fairly barren.  This might look more desolate with stormy skies and raging water.  It really is a stunning shot, though.  Bumping up the score for that.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot.  Initiallly I knocked it a bit because it doesn''t have a ''sad'' feeling.  It''s almost too pretty, and the water looks too inviting.  But looking at is closer, I see that the rocks are fairly barren.  This might look more desolate with stormy skies and raging water.  It really is a stunning shot, though.  Bumping up the score for that.', '2006-06-24 04:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2547786, 349422, 38496, '<td valign="top">This guy doesn''t really look like he''s desolate.  He looks more like he''s happy to be alone, and is just relaxing.</td>', 'This guy doesn''t really look like he''s desolate.  He looks more like he''s happy to be alone, and is just relaxing.', '2006-06-24 04:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2547788, 347874, 38496, '<td valign="top">I like a lot of things about this.  The monotone coloring of the building makes the man really stand out.  I like the repition of the blue jeans in the reflection of the sky in the window.  I like the interest in the old wood.  And I like the ''sad'' feeling of the man sitting with his head in his hands.  Well done!</td>', 'I like a lot of things about this.  The monotone coloring of the building makes the man really stand out.  I like the repition of the blue jeans in the reflection of the sky in the window.  I like the interest in the old wood.  And I like the ''sad'' feeling of the man sitting with his head in his hands.  Well done!', '2006-06-24 04:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2547791, 348596, 38496, '<td valign="top">Yup, that looks pretty desolate.  I once had a summer job walking barbed wire fences in NM, looking for breaks.  A desolate job for sure.  Nice entry.</td>', 'Yup, that looks pretty desolate.  I once had a summer job walking barbed wire fences in NM, looking for breaks.  A desolate job for sure.  Nice entry.', '2006-06-24 04:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
