(2549687, 348761, 60905, '<td valign="top">the word desolate is a very lonely one, and this photo i think comes pretty darned near, the fog is a perfect touch to give that feeling and the lamp post is very well presented and, in a great angle, i will give this a high score becouse it is pretty close to what i picture desolate to be.</td>', 'the word desolate is a very lonely one, and this photo i think comes pretty darned near, the fog is a perfect touch to give that feeling and the lamp post is very well presented and, in a great angle, i will give this a high score becouse it is pretty close to what i picture desolate to be.', '2006-06-24 21:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549693, 349192, 60905, '<td valign="top">i am not sure i see desolation here, unless i am thinking differently as many of us do and we all picture things differently. I am trying very hard to judge fairly, so i will go middle road on this one, please for give me if i am offbase.<br/>it is a cute picture of a cat who looks like a little devil! LOL<br/>the leash does not give the feeling of desolate, or, the food dishes in the background, there is a lot of clutter that gives one the sense of a home.<br/>i think an alley might be a better setting?</td>', 'i am not sure i see desolation here, unless i am thinking differently as many of us do and we all picture things differently. I am trying very hard to judge fairly, so i will go middle road on this one, please for give me if i am offbase.it is a cute picture of a cat who looks like a little devil! LOLthe leash does not give the feeling of desolate, or, the food dishes in the background, there is a lot of clutter that gives one the sense of a home.i think an alley might be a better setting?', '2006-06-24 21:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549701, 348303, 60905, '<td valign="top">a very good photo to depict this word, nice choice and giving that sense and a sense of sadness, it really would make an impact if the watch that the boy was holding, i assume daddy`s watch, was more in focus, all in all a very nice job, thank you for sharing this special sad moment.</td>', 'a very good photo to depict this word, nice choice and giving that sense and a sense of sadness, it really would make an impact if the watch that the boy was holding, i assume daddy`s watch, was more in focus, all in all a very nice job, thank you for sharing this special sad moment.', '2006-06-24 21:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549704, 349592, 60905, '<td valign="top">This captures the word to a tee, what a twisted mess of homes and property, how sad for people, to bad they cant choose to live more inland, hard to do i am sure as living waterside is a wonderful thing, but, all things come with risk.<br/>hopefully the rebuilding has started.<br/>You captured this well therefore a high score for you.</td>', 'This captures the word to a tee, what a twisted mess of homes and property, how sad for people, to bad they cant choose to live more inland, hard to do i am sure as living waterside is a wonderful thing, but, all things come with risk.hopefully the rebuilding has started.You captured this well therefore a high score for you.', '2006-06-24 21:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2549706, 349568, 60905, '<td valign="top">i think if this was not so close up and not such a creative angle i would get that feeling of an empty coop, right now as is,  i dont get that feeling, most likely due to the small amount of the building being visible.<br/>i may be wrong or offbase as we all see things differently and comprehend different, so hopefully i dont offend.<br/>i would advise photo this from further back allowing us to see more of the building, in lonliness and maybe even neglect.</td>', 'i think if this was not so close up and not such a creative angle i would get that feeling of an empty coop, right now as is,  i dont get that feeling, most likely due to the small amount of the building being visible.i may be wrong or offbase as we all see things differently and comprehend different, so hopefully i dont offend.i would advise photo this from further back allowing us to see more of the building, in lonliness and maybe even neglect.', '2006-06-24 21:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
