(2551321, 349515, 57658, '<td valign="top">This one really stood out for me when I went through the list. Good choice of subject - doesn''t meat the connotations of desolation to my mind but WOW. I''ll let someone else tell you that it isn''t horizon paralleled. 8</td>', 'This one really stood out for me when I went through the list. Good choice of subject - doesn''t meat the connotations of desolation to my mind but WOW. I''ll let someone else tell you that it isn''t horizon paralleled. 8', '2006-06-25 12:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
