(2551326, 349248, 57658, '<td valign="top">I love the composition here - something doesn''t feel right though and I can''t put my finger on it - maybe its the fact that the light is on the desolate person instead of being away from him ? - 7</td>', 'I love the composition here - something doesn''t feel right though and I can''t put my finger on it - maybe its the fact that the light is on the desolate person instead of being away from him ? - 7', '2006-06-25 12:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551328, 346905, 57658, '<td valign="top">very nice. 7.</td>', 'very nice. 7.', '2006-06-25 12:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551329, 349036, 57658, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Excellent muted colors - it would have been more impressive without the automobile but I suppose that can''t be helped. Meets the challenge perfectly. 7</td>', 'Very nicely done. Excellent muted colors - it would have been more impressive without the automobile but I suppose that can''t be helped. Meets the challenge perfectly. 7', '2006-06-25 12:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551330, 348850, 57658, '<td valign="top">very nice idea - but the light on the hand is different from the light in the background which doesn''t feel right (studio shot). Also it looks like the horizon is tilted. - 6</td>', 'very nice idea - but the light on the hand is different from the light in the background which doesn''t feel right (studio shot). Also it looks like the horizon is tilted. - 6', '2006-06-25 12:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551331, 348756, 57658, '<td valign="top">The style of the photography seems to blend color into desolation which really doesn''t work well... Fascinating choice of subject though. 7</td>', 'The style of the photography seems to blend color into desolation which really doesn''t work well... Fascinating choice of subject though. 7', '2006-06-25 12:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551332, 348917, 57658, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and good use of color. 7</td>', 'Nice idea and good use of color. 7', '2006-06-25 12:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551333, 349495, 57658, '<td valign="top">looks like the contrast was hard to handle - you have almost blown highlights on the top and very dark shadows. Good location choice. 6</td>', 'looks like the contrast was hard to handle - you have almost blown highlights on the top and very dark shadows. Good location choice. 6', '2006-06-25 12:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551334, 349266, 57658, '<td valign="top">Cool - nice focus and exposure. The candleholder being partly in the frame is distracting. and it seems a little too cropped on the right. Its doesn''t really connotate desolation though. 6</td>', 'Cool - nice focus and exposure. The candleholder being partly in the frame is distracting. and it seems a little too cropped on the right. Its doesn''t really connotate desolation though. 6', '2006-06-25 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551335, 348270, 57658, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but without the title it seems like she''s meditating and not desolate. I suppose the choice of her dress and pose has some role in that.Lovely colors and the way the water and sky form a single element. It might have been more impressive without the model. 6</td>', 'Nice composition but without the title it seems like she''s meditating and not desolate. I suppose the choice of her dress and pose has some role in that.Lovely colors and the way the water and sky form a single element. It might have been more impressive without the model. 6', '2006-06-25 12:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551336, 348842, 18080, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfuly sureal image.<br/>Realy well taken and the PP is spot on.<br/>9<br/> <br/>Good luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'What a wonderfuly sureal image.Realy well taken and the PP is spot on.9 Good luck Kev', '2006-06-25 12:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551337, 348099, 57658, '<td valign="top">Nice colors - but just looking at it doesn''t make me think desolate. <br/>Update - I thought about it and this does meet desolation better than other entries so upgrading 7.</td>', 'Nice colors - but just looking at it doesn''t make me think desolate. Update - I thought about it and this does meet desolation better than other entries so upgrading 7.', '2006-06-25 12:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551338, 349322, 57658, '<td valign="top">Good composition but the picture doesnt imply desolation - only the title does.. Perhaps if you had more of the partly built lower floors ? 5.</td>', 'Good composition but the picture doesnt imply desolation - only the title does.. Perhaps if you had more of the partly built lower floors ? 5.', '2006-06-25 12:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551339, 349503, 57658, '<td valign="top">too much going on here - maybe in black and white.. nice simple idea though. 5</td>', 'too much going on here - maybe in black and white.. nice simple idea though. 5', '2006-06-25 12:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551340, 349075, 18080, '<td valign="top">Excelent colours in this shot.<br/>Looks unreal, i''m sure it''s not.<br/>9<br/> <br/>Good luck<br/> <br/>Kev</td>', 'Excelent colours in this shot.Looks unreal, i''m sure it''s not.9 Good luck Kev', '2006-06-25 12:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551343, 347210, 57658, '<td valign="top">The mountain is deserted but not desolate because there is no misery involved. Its very pretty but not quite desolation. I love how the colors reflect off the bottom of the clouds. 6</td>', 'The mountain is deserted but not desolate because there is no misery involved. Its very pretty but not quite desolation. I love how the colors reflect off the bottom of the clouds. 6', '2006-06-25 12:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551344, 347784, 57658, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Good idea and is desolation but I can''t find a spot that my eye wants to rest on. The cropping seems a bit aggressive. You could try putting the center of the tunnel into a golden ratio type composition. The colors don''t work for me - Seems like afternoon sun and everything is washed out. 5</td>', 'Interesting. Good idea and is desolation but I can''t find a spot that my eye wants to rest on. The cropping seems a bit aggressive. You could try putting the center of the tunnel into a golden ratio type composition. The colors don''t work for me - Seems like afternoon sun and everything is washed out. 5', '2006-06-25 12:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551345, 348797, 57658, '<td valign="top">Solitary isn''t the same as desolate. Excellent shot and good DOF though. 4</td>', 'Solitary isn''t the same as desolate. Excellent shot and good DOF though. 4', '2006-06-25 12:13:48.000000', NULL, 1);
