(2551770, 349226, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, I think I''d like to see just the skull and surrounding area, not the prairie dog(?). I think just the skull and land would be perfect for this challenge.</td>', 'Cute picture, I think I''d like to see just the skull and surrounding area, not the prairie dog(?). I think just the skull and land would be perfect for this challenge.', '2006-06-25 15:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551773, 349592, 43774, '<td valign="top">Wow, what devastation. Certainly meets the theme, good composition as well to show more elements around the house and not just the house itself. And the tree standing tall there sort of represents nature''s triumph over man, don''t you think?</td>', 'Wow, what devastation. Certainly meets the theme, good composition as well to show more elements around the house and not just the house itself. And the tree standing tall there sort of represents nature''s triumph over man, don''t you think?', '2006-06-25 15:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551776, 349481, 43774, '<td valign="top">Interesting, surreal looking photo. Needs a bit of work, though. It''s tilted slightly to the left and I feel the person is too centered.</td>', 'Interesting, surreal looking photo. Needs a bit of work, though. It''s tilted slightly to the left and I feel the person is too centered.', '2006-06-25 15:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
