(2551782, 348756, 43774, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the over exposed and purple sky, it is just too unnatural. Your composition is good and it does show desolation. I think the purple sky will hurt your scores though.</td>', 'I don''t like the over exposed and purple sky, it is just too unnatural. Your composition is good and it does show desolation. I think the purple sky will hurt your scores though.', '2006-06-25 15:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551786, 349203, 43774, '<td valign="top">I am sure you will get lots of comments on your border. I don''t find it enhances the photo at all, in fact it is quite distracting. I would like to see more DOF in your photo, as it is now most of it is not in focus. The sky looks splotchy. The colours in the field are good, though.</td>', 'I am sure you will get lots of comments on your border. I don''t find it enhances the photo at all, in fact it is quite distracting. I would like to see more DOF in your photo, as it is now most of it is not in focus. The sky looks splotchy. The colours in the field are good, though.', '2006-06-25 15:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551787, 348572, 50034, '<td valign="top">Our Jeopardy question is "What would make fast food restauranteurs consider a ''Swim-Through'' option?"<br/>   "Welcome to McDuck''s!  May I take your order please?"<br/>   "I''d like a Drink with some Quackers, Please"<br/>   "Of course, sir!  I''ll put it on your Bill!"  ;)</td>', 'Our Jeopardy question is "What would make fast food restauranteurs consider a ''Swim-Through'' option?"   "Welcome to McDuck''s!  May I take your order please?"   "I''d like a Drink with some Quackers, Please"   "Of course, sir!  I''ll put it on your Bill!"  ;)', '2006-06-25 15:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551788, 349380, 43774, '<td valign="top">Your horizon is tilted....that should always be fixed before entering in challenges. I feel the shipwreck is too centered.</td>', 'Your horizon is tilted....that should always be fixed before entering in challenges. I feel the shipwreck is too centered.', '2006-06-25 15:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551790, 349127, 43774, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better either without the girl or with a different pose. I realize she has her hands over her ears (I don''t really know why) but to me she looks happy and smiling. Maybe a pose where she is looking down or on her knees in the grass would have suited the rest of the photo and this challenge better. The rest of the photo is excellent.</td>', 'I would have liked this better either without the girl or with a different pose. I realize she has her hands over her ears (I don''t really know why) but to me she looks happy and smiling. Maybe a pose where she is looking down or on her knees in the grass would have suited the rest of the photo and this challenge better. The rest of the photo is excellent.', '2006-06-25 15:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551796, 349543, 50034, '<td valign="top">Body Language seems a bit grandiose for desolation, but OKAY!  It is one amazing landscape photograph.  However, I have to take off a few points for size of jpeg to be consistent with the composite website mindset.  5 points.</td>', 'Body Language seems a bit grandiose for desolation, but OKAY!  It is one amazing landscape photograph.  However, I have to take off a few points for size of jpeg to be consistent with the composite website mindset.  5 points.', '2006-06-25 15:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2551804, 347147, 50034, '<td valign="top">I totally agree with the message &amp; the concept!  However, to be consistent with photographic technique &amp; challenge theme, I have to grade this lower simply because the point of the photo is really upbeat whereas the purpose of the contest is to demonstrate the feeling of being morose.</td>', 'I totally agree with the message & the concept!  However, to be consistent with photographic technique & challenge theme, I have to grade this lower simply because the point of the photo is really upbeat whereas the purpose of the contest is to demonstrate the feeling of being morose.', '2006-06-25 15:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
