(2552758, 349036, 39484, '<td valign="top">This is a great image with a compelling narrative.  What is that man doing?  Is he grieving? Is he part of a funeral procession?<br/>Technically everything is good.  Only thing that comes to mind is using PSCS2''s lens distortion correction to fix the building.  (It looks like it is falling over and not perpendicular to the ground.)  You could also experiment with darkening the upper corners to keep the eye in a bit, but it works fine. 10.</td>', 'This is a great image with a compelling narrative.  What is that man doing?  Is he grieving? Is he part of a funeral procession?Technically everything is good.  Only thing that comes to mind is using PSCS2''s lens distortion correction to fix the building.  (It looks like it is falling over and not perpendicular to the ground.)  You could also experiment with darkening the upper corners to keep the eye in a bit, but it works fine. 10.', '2006-06-25 22:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2552762, 349168, 29906, '<td valign="top">Good job, should score high in this challenge.</td>', 'Good job, should score high in this challenge.', '2006-06-25 22:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
