(2552836, 347943, 22975, '<td valign="top">Very interesting... almost doesn''t look real... but I think it meets the challenge wonderfully and was beautifully done.  I can''t vote, but if I could, I''d give you a 9.</td>', 'Very interesting... almost doesn''t look real... but I think it meets the challenge wonderfully and was beautifully done.  I can''t vote, but if I could, I''d give you a 9.', '2006-06-25 22:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
