(2552871, 349333, 22975, '<td valign="top">Cool textures in this, and I like the angle, too.  Nice rich colors, as well!!</td>', 'Cool textures in this, and I like the angle, too.  Nice rich colors, as well!!', '2006-06-25 22:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
