(2553718, 349024, 17072, '<td valign="top">She was ok. She has a tiny fracture above her eye, but the dr''s said it would heal nicely. As of today, the bump on the forehead is gone and her eye looks like it has a small purple smudge under it. <br/> <br/>This pic is one in a series I took for when we go to court. We''re suing the company that had the faulty seatbelt that broke and tossed her carseat into the street.</td>', 'She was ok. She has a tiny fracture above her eye, but the dr''s said it would heal nicely. As of today, the bump on the forehead is gone and her eye looks like it has a small purple smudge under it.  This pic is one in a series I took for when we go to court. We''re suing the company that had the faulty seatbelt that broke and tossed her carseat into the street.', '2006-06-26 02:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
