(2553799, 349024, 29011, '<td valign="top">So very saddened to read of the news :( <br/>I was hoping the black eye was a product of editing not reality. With the pic blurry in some places I couldn''t make it out.<br/> <br/>I wish a fast and easy and 100% recovery to your sweet daughter and this will all be a distant memory to you, her, your family and friends.<br/>Glad to read your comment below knowing she is getting better and it wasn''t something more serious than it already is. Good luck!</td>', 'So very saddened to read of the news :( I was hoping the black eye was a product of editing not reality. With the pic blurry in some places I couldn''t make it out. I wish a fast and easy and 100% recovery to your sweet daughter and this will all be a distant memory to you, her, your family and friends.Glad to read your comment below knowing she is getting better and it wasn''t something more serious than it already is. Good luck!', '2006-06-26 02:53:01.000000', NULL, 0),
