(2553984, 348885, 27133, '<td valign="top">Linda, I am sorry you feel let down with the voting on this.  For the record I gave you a 6.  But I can see why it was low in voting.  The contrast is way to heavy and shadowy causing a false feel to the sky.  I like the colours and feel if you had concentrated on a particular area of this building it might have done better.  The image is quite busy and with voters you really need simplicity to win their vote.<br/> <br/>Anyways...on a positive note...you did better than me lol!<br/> <br/>Judi</td>', 'Linda, I am sorry you feel let down with the voting on this.  For the record I gave you a 6.  But I can see why it was low in voting.  The contrast is way to heavy and shadowy causing a false feel to the sky.  I like the colours and feel if you had concentrated on a particular area of this building it might have done better.  The image is quite busy and with voters you really need simplicity to win their vote. Anyways...on a positive note...you did better than me lol! Judi', '2006-06-26 05:16:15.000000', NULL, 0),
