(2554118, 348797, 57658, '<td valign="top">Ahh .. that explains the PM :). You keyed off the synonyms instead of the word. For example: empty is not the same as solitary or ruined or desert. They are meant to approximate desolate not replace it. If you were going for solitary and bleak you nailed it. Hoep that helps.<br/> <br/>And yes I know this isn''t a grammar site so I''m sorry we don''t think about it the same way. Sorry. Gorgeous image though...</td>', 'Ahh .. that explains the PM :). You keyed off the synonyms instead of the word. For example: empty is not the same as solitary or ruined or desert. They are meant to approximate desolate not replace it. If you were going for solitary and bleak you nailed it. Hoep that helps. And yes I know this isn''t a grammar site so I''m sorry we don''t think about it the same way. Sorry. Gorgeous image though...', '2006-06-26 08:15:54.000000', NULL, 0),
