(2555473, 349480, 40718, '<td valign="top">you must have hit on a good image, because you scored a 5.4 with some clear problems on PP.  The immediate issue I noticed was the pixelation in the grays.  The puddle reflection and above the bench as well.  Ah, I see you did posterize.  I''m not quite sure why (although I don''t have a ton of experience with the effect).<br/> <br/>The composition and subject give a nice desolation feel.  At first I wanted to crop out the large tree or rock on the right, but I decided, in the end, that it works with it in.</td>', 'you must have hit on a good image, because you scored a 5.4 with some clear problems on PP.  The immediate issue I noticed was the pixelation in the grays.  The puddle reflection and above the bench as well.  Ah, I see you did posterize.  I''m not quite sure why (although I don''t have a ton of experience with the effect). The composition and subject give a nice desolation feel.  At first I wanted to crop out the large tree or rock on the right, but I decided, in the end, that it works with it in.', '2006-06-26 17:05:07.000000', NULL, 0),
