(2555814, 347943, 40370, '<td valign="top">Hey Katherine (help, I can''t remember what we called you at the GTG in Moab, Katie?) ... nice job with this image, it definitely stood out during voting (8 from me). I did pause to examine Joe''s outfit, I wondered if he had a skirt on (my brother-in-law bought a man skirt once but I think we teased him out of wearing it, it didn''t go with his Ducks Unlimited ballcap and LL Bean wool shirt) anyway congrats on a decent finish.</td>', 'Hey Katherine (help, I can''t remember what we called you at the GTG in Moab, Katie?) ... nice job with this image, it definitely stood out during voting (8 from me). I did pause to examine Joe''s outfit, I wondered if he had a skirt on (my brother-in-law bought a man skirt once but I think we teased him out of wearing it, it didn''t go with his Ducks Unlimited ballcap and LL Bean wool shirt) anyway congrats on a decent finish.', '2006-06-26 19:15:42.000000', NULL, 0),
