(2559518, 349248, 37961, '<td valign="top">It would appear this is more my comfort zone. LOL <br/>I think you did well, and its great your extending your photographic vision trying different things. <br/> <br/>I think it being all vertical is somewhat bothersome to me. But I can understand why you shot it this way. I may have liked to see it further away, or with a wide angle and horizontally shot.<br/> <br/>The lighting and colors are great though.</td>', 'It would appear this is more my comfort zone. LOL I think you did well, and its great your extending your photographic vision trying different things.  I think it being all vertical is somewhat bothersome to me. But I can understand why you shot it this way. I may have liked to see it further away, or with a wide angle and horizontally shot. The lighting and colors are great though.', '2006-06-27 22:33:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2559530, 349205, 20941, '<td valign="top">Great Shot! I thought this might be yours! I was ever so close to going to DUMBO with the same kind of scene in mind... one of these days we''re gonna be in the same spot at the same time! Very cool shot Congrats!</td>', 'Great Shot! I thought this might be yours! I was ever so close to going to DUMBO with the same kind of scene in mind... one of these days we''re gonna be in the same spot at the same time! Very cool shot Congrats!', '2006-06-27 22:38:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2560290, 348544, 36006, '<td valign="top">Could of been a contender.<br/> <br/>did you try differant angles? or did you just stick with this angle?<br/> <br/>What about differant lens? did you experiment with editing? or were you satisfied with your first attempt?<br/> <br/>I''m watching you because I see something. So lets see it next time.</td>', 'Could of been a contender. did you try differant angles? or did you just stick with this angle? What about differant lens? did you experiment with editing? or were you satisfied with your first attempt? I''m watching you because I see something. So lets see it next time.', '2006-06-28 01:49:32.000000', NULL, 0),
