(2566219, 348054, 23203, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique Club<br/> <br/>Nice InfraRed photograph<br/> <br/>It seems that you intentionally chose a long exposure, which caused the leaves to go blurry because of the wind. It went a touch too long, as the rightmost tree steals viewer attention from the subject, which appears just a touch too small in the photograph.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the critique Club Nice InfraRed photograph It seems that you intentionally chose a long exposure, which caused the leaves to go blurry because of the wind. It went a touch too long, as the rightmost tree steals viewer attention from the subject, which appears just a touch too small in the photograph. ', '2006-06-29 13:22:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2566400, 348991, 38496, '<td valign="top">Another that should have scored highter (imho).  I love the colors in this, and the concept of being far away is interesting, and I think the moon adds a necessary compositional feature, so that it isn''t just a ''boring'' mountain top.  It gives the image some interest, and the viewer something to think about, in connection with the title.  The mountain top is definately desolate looking.  Nice job!<br/>I''m looking forward to seeing your flower entry!</td>', 'Another that should have scored highter (imho).  I love the colors in this, and the concept of being far away is interesting, and I think the moon adds a necessary compositional feature, so that it isn''t just a ''boring'' mountain top.  It gives the image some interest, and the viewer something to think about, in connection with the title.  The mountain top is definately desolate looking.  Nice job!I''m looking forward to seeing your flower entry!', '2006-06-29 14:18:43.000000', NULL, 0),
