(2592993, 349600, 50695, '<td valign="top">I gave this picture a 7. It intrigues the hell out of me. It looks like a row of televisions on a floor of woodchips, and each television is showing a video of the floor of woodchips. It looks like an art installation. and definitely it is about desolation. I think I underscored it.</td>', 'I gave this picture a 7. It intrigues the hell out of me. It looks like a row of televisions on a floor of woodchips, and each television is showing a video of the floor of woodchips. It looks like an art installation. and definitely it is about desolation. I think I underscored it.', '2006-07-06 11:42:20.000000', NULL, 0),
